Mishra.

254
00:15:42.168 --> 00:15:43.328
You call me from Kashi for a day..

255
00:15:43.402 --> 00:15:44.494
..and make me travel the entire day.

256
00:15:45.935 --> 00:15:48.062
lt's a small area.

257
