258
00:15:50.201 --> 00:15:51.600
..they'll cast their votes for me.

259
00:15:52.234 --> 00:15:55.533
Glory to..
- Siddeshwar Maharaj.

260
00:16:04.299 --> 00:16:06.096
''What's this fervour?''
''What's this obsession?''

261
00:16:06.165 --> 00:16:07.962
''What's this craze?''

262
00:16:08.032 --> 00:16:09.795
''What's this fervour?''

263
00:16:10.398 --> 00:16:11.422
''Tell me. Tell me.''

264
00:16:11.498 --> 00:16:13.261
''What's this fervour?''
''What's this obsession?''

265
00:16:13.297 --> 00:16:15.128
''What's this craze?''

266
00:16:15.197 --> 00:16:18.826
''What's this passion all around?''

267
00:16:19.197 --> 00:16:22.530
''We'll lose ourselves in your joy.''

268
00:16:22.929 --> 00:16:26.160
''We'll lose
ourselves in your devotion.''

269
00:16:26.361 --> 00:16:28.090
''Even if we've to lay down our lives.''

270
00:16:28.161 --> 00:16:29.958
''But we promise.''

271
00:16:30.028 --> 00:16:32.963
''We won't let you go.''

272
00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:41.087
''Go...go...go...Govinda.''

273
00:16:42.159 --> 00:16:44.059
Look, Sonakshi Sinha.

274
00:16:44.159 --> 00:16:46.184
She is Rowdy,
my Rathore's in the next alley.

275
00:16:46.259 --> 00:16:49.023
Let's go. Come on.
- Yes.

276
00:16:51.791 --> 00:16:53.122
''Break the pot.''

277
00:16:57.391 --> 00:16:59.120
''Go...go...go...Govinda.''

278
00:17:03.856 --> 00:17:05.255
''Go...go...go...Govinda.''

279
00:17:05.756 --> 00:17:08.088
Begin with the festivities.

280
00:17:10.122 --> 00:17:11.885
''Go...go...go...Govinda.''

281
00:17:16.721 --> 00:17:18.154
''Go...go...go...Govinda.''

282
00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:24.817
''Go...go...go...Govinda.''

283
00:17:28.719 --> 00:17:30.186
''Go...go...go...Govinda.''

284
00:17:31.452 --> 00:17:33.283
What's going on here? Move.

285
00:17:35.185 --> 00:17:36.243
Get down

286
00:17:39.851 --> 00:17:41.409
''Go...go...go...Govinda.''

287
00:17:42.818 --> 00:17:43.944
Come here.
- Yes.

288
00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:47.147
''Go...go...go...Govinda.''

289
00:17:51.882 --> 00:17:53.713
''Go...go...go...Govinda.''

290
00:17:53.782 --> 00:17:54.840
Break it.

291
00:17:55.315 --> 00:17:56.714
Hear! Hear! Hear! Hear!

292
00:17:56.749 --> 00:17:59.411
Calm down! Calm down!

293
00:18:00.081 --> 00:18:01.810
lt's the Swami's orders.

294
00:18:01.881 --> 00:18:02.939
Calm down!

295
00:18:03.281 --> 00:18:04.976
Calm down! Calm down!

296
00:18:05.780 --> 00:18:07.111
What orders?

297
00:18:07.847 --> 00:18:11.749
Sri Siddeshwar Maharaj has just said..

298
00:18:12.180 --> 00:18:15.843
..that Lord Krishna is very pleased..

299
00:18:16.112 --> 00:18:18.080
..to see the crowd
that has gathered around..

300
00:18:18.145 --> 00:18:20.113
..for the 'Janmastami' festivities.

301
00:18:20.179 --> 00:18:24.912
And today He'll eat milk
and butter from His devotees.

302
00:18:25.644 --> 00:18:28.340
Yes, He'll drink milk and eat butter.

303
00:18:28.844 --> 00:18:30.744
And Siddeshwar
Maharaj also says that..

304
00:18:30.843 --> 00:18:34.335
..this auspicious
opportunity will last only for an hour.

305
00:18:34.643 --> 00:18:36.076
Only one hour.

306
00:18:36.142 --> 00:18:38.838
So, your time begins now.

307
00:18:38.909 --> 00:18:41.207
Go. Go.
- Who is that imposter?

308
00:18:41.675 --> 00:18:42.767
Hello.

309
00:18:43.308 --> 00:18:44.639
Play it, play it.

310
00:18:45.841 --> 00:18:47.638
Go ahead, feed Him.
- What's wrong with the mic?

311
00:18:47.674 --> 00:18:49.005
Take a look.
- What's wrong with the mic?

312
00:18:49.074 --> 00:18:50.837
Where's everyone going?

313
00:18:50.907 --> 00:18:52.067
Go, go.
- No.

314
00:18:52.140 --> 00:18:55.075
Where are you going?
- Go.

315
00:18:55.640 --> 00:18:57.073
Get down.

316
00:18:57.206 --> 00:18:59.640
Play it.
- Wait everyone. Wait.

317
00:18:59.672 --> 00:19:03.233
Even Siddeshwar
Maharaj is asking you to go.

318
00:19:04.572 --> 00:19:06.972
Go, go, leave.
- Leave me.

319
00:19:07.038 --> 00:19:08.198
What have you done?

320
00:19:08.271 --> 00:19:11.206
No, papa. - Fool,
breaking pots during exam times.

321
00:19:13.104 --> 00:19:14.662
Stop it, stop it.

322
00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:16.237
Go and feed some butter to the Lord.

323
00:19:20.003 --> 00:19:21.561
l won't stop you next time.

324
00:19:21.636 --> 00:19:22.898
Stop you fool!

325
00:19:23.903 --> 00:19:26.929
You'll be punished for
your unpardonable sin.

326
00:19:28.202 --> 00:19:30.033
He will punish you Himself.

327
00:19:31.101 --> 00:19:32.568
He will punish you.

328
00:19:34.101 --> 00:19:36.228
Don't try to scare me
in the name of Lord.

329
00:19:37.767 --> 00:19:39.564
l'll see what He does to me.

330
00:19:43.633 --> 00:19:44.998
Go home, it's going to rain.

331
00:19:45.032 --> 00:19:46.124
You'll get drenched.

332
00:19:51.165 --> 00:19:52.792
lt's an earthquake.

333
00:19:54.165 --> 00:19:55.792
Swamiji Rain?

334
00:19:56.131 --> 00:19:58.099
Rain?
- Rain?

335
00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:04.854
My hand's paining.

336
00:20:04.929 --> 00:20:06.157
l won't be able to
write my exam tomorrow.

337
00:20:06.229 --> 00:20:07.287
l'll slap you.

338
00:20:07.562 --> 00:20:09.621
l'll make you hold the pen in
your mouth and write your paper.

339
00:20:10.562 --> 00:20:11.893
You're scolding him.

340
00:20:11.961 --> 00:20:14.122
But what about you?
- What did l do?

341
00:20:14.195 --> 00:20:15.287
What?

342
00:20:15.728 --> 00:20:17.787
The festivities were left incomplete.

343
00:20:18.161 --> 00:20:19.253
You've to admit that there's God.

344
00:20:19.561 --> 00:20:20.653
You spread the rumour..

345
00:20:20.727 --> 00:20:21.989
..and immediately
there was an earthquake.

346
00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:23.755
- Remember.
- What earthquake?

347
00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:26.094
Even the utensils didn't budge.

348
00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:28.593
Papa.

349
00:20:28.793 --> 00:20:31.728
l think they took your
announcement too seriously.

350
00:20:31.925 --> 00:20:35.759
This news just came in
from parts of the country..

351
00:20:35.825 --> 00:20:39.625
..that the idol of Sri
Krishna's eating butter.

352
00:20:39.757 --> 00:20:41.691
ls the Lord eating butter?
- No.

353
00:20:41.991 --> 00:20:44.585
Priest, offer the
Lord some buttermilk.

354
00:20:44.757 --> 00:20:48.249
People are offering cheese,
cottage-cheese..

355
00:20:48.556 --> 00:20:50.786
..butter, buttermilk to
the idol of Krishna. - Oh, God!

356
00:20:50.856 --> 00:20:52.721
The rumour has spread so far.

357
00:20:52.889 --> 00:20:54.288
Please, eat it.

358
00:20:54.588 --> 00:20:56.681
This is low-cholesterol cheese.

359
00:20:56.755 --> 00:20:58.723
The Lord's so lucky.

360
00:20:59.255 --> 00:21:01.519
Look at the things He's getting.

361
00:21:01.954 --> 00:21:03.717
Earlier, people would keep
it in a covered platter..

362
00:21:03.788 --> 00:21:04.584
..in front of Him.

363
00:21:04.654 --> 00:21:06.519
But now they're feeding Him.

364
00:21:07.053 --> 00:21:08.042
Let Him enjoy.

365
00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:09.712
lt's your fault.

366
00:21:11.586 --> 00:21:14.146
Mumbai just experienced a
slight earthquake tremor..

367
00:21:14.219 --> 00:21:16.847
..of 3.5 Richter scale,
which didn't cause..

368
00:21:17.086 --> 00:21:19.179
..any harm to life or property.

369
00:21:19.485 --> 00:21:21.851
See. Heard that?

370
00:21:21.918 --> 00:21:24.478
But a shop in the flea
market has collapsed..

371
00:21:24.518 --> 00:21:25.746
..which was closed at that time.

372
00:21:26.117 --> 00:21:28.711
Must be Mohammad's shop.

373
00:21:28.784 --> 00:21:30.547
According to our sources..

374
00:21:30.617 --> 00:21:34.713
..the shop was registered
to Mr. Kanji Lalji Mehta.

375
00:21:39.516 --> 00:21:40.847
lt's really surprising, because..

376
00:21:40.915 --> 00:21:46.182
..there are other old shops in
this market which are still intact.

377
00:21:46.481 --> 00:21:50.577
But Kanji Lalji Mehta's shop
has been completely destroyed.

378
00:21:50.647 --> 00:21:54.515
This is Shweta Tiwari, with
cameraman Vaibhav Mishra, ABP News.

379
00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:57.207
Sister, switch on ABP News quickly.

380
00:21:57.746 --> 00:21:58.713
We saw.

381
00:21:58.780 --> 00:22:00.407
Brother-in-law's shop
is gone. lt's collapsed.

382
00:22:00.446 --> 00:22:02.710
Pravin!
- Calm down, father.

383
00:22:03.445 --> 00:22:05.037
No, sister. Come
there with the children.

384
00:22:05.111 --> 00:22:07.409
l'm coming there with
father and the others. - Yes.

385
00:22:07.478 --> 00:22:08.467
Yes, we're coming.

386
00:22:08.511 --> 00:22:09.876
We're coming.

387
00:22:12.744 --> 00:22:15.770
The idols of Gods
have gone underneath.

388
00:22:28.008 --> 00:22:29.669
The shop is completely ruined

389
00:22:30.075 --> 00:22:32.737
Doesn't seem like
there was ever a shop here.

390
00:22:32.808 --> 00:22:33.866
What are you saying?

391
00:22:33.940 --> 00:22:36.067
We had goods worth 25 lakhs.

392
00:22:36.141 --> 00:22:38.701
And we'll have to
pay the scrap dealer..

393
00:22:38.774 --> 00:22:40.139
..to have this cleared.

394
00:22:40.406 --> 00:22:41.532
Why pay?

395
00:22:41.806 --> 00:22:43.706
We'll give him one
of the broken idols..

396
00:22:43.773 --> 00:22:45.968
..and say ''lt appeared
from the ground in Amarnath''.

397
00:22:46.038 --> 00:22:48.029
What are you saying, brother-in-law?

398
00:22:48.105 --> 00:22:49.766
You'll soon be bankrupt.

399
00:22:49.838 --> 00:22:51.897
Do you know the
losses you've incurred?

400
00:22:51.972 --> 00:22:53.405
40 lakhs.

401
00:22:53.837 --> 00:22:55.600
Goods worth 25 lakhs
bought on credit..

402
00:22:55.670 --> 00:22:57.570
..and 15 lakhs spent on
renovation last month.

403
00:22:58.104 --> 00:23:00.595
40 lakhs? Where did you
get that kind of money?

404
00:23:00.903 --> 00:23:05.397
We borrowed a part of the
amount by mortgaging the house.

405
00:23:06.436 --> 00:23:10.338
And l borrowed 10 lakhs from a friend.

406
00:23:10.401 --> 00:23:12.335
And 5 lakhs from your own pocket..

407
00:23:12.401 --> 00:23:14.392
..for earning 18% interest.

408
00:23:14.468 --> 00:23:15.799
Pravin, you fool.

409
00:23:15.868 --> 00:23:17.426
You didn't even ask me.

410
00:23:19.567 --> 00:23:21.535
How will we arrange
for such a huge sum?

411
00:23:22.767 --> 00:23:25.031
There's hardly 30-40
thousand in the bank.

412
00:23:25.666 --> 00:23:27.964
And we don't even have jewellery.

413
00:23:28.333 --> 00:23:32.736
Sushila. We'll manage.
- How?

414
00:23:34.332 --> 00:23:35.890
Why don't you understand?

415
00:23:37.631 --> 00:23:39.929
lf you hadn't spoken
ill about the Lord..

416
00:23:39.997 --> 00:23:41.328
..He wouldn't have
caused this earthquake.

417
00:23:41.631 --> 00:23:44.691
His justice is silent.

418
00:23:44.764 --> 00:23:47.460
Will you please stop preaching?

419
00:23:48.597 --> 00:23:50.758
You mean to say, that the Lord..

420
00:23:50.829 --> 00:23:53.957
..who doesn't exist,
razed down my shop..

421
00:23:54.028 --> 00:23:55.757
..because l spoke ill about Him?

422
00:23:57.329 --> 00:24:00.662
So, just to prove Himself..

423
00:24:01.261 --> 00:24:04.389
..he razed down just
my shop in a fit of rage.

424
00:24:04.961 --> 00:24:06.792
And if l still don't believe in Him..

425
00:24:06.861 --> 00:24:09.728
..he will make me incur more losses?
- Yes.

426
00:24:09.793 --> 00:24:10.817
What yes?

427
00:24:11.826 --> 00:24:13.760
l still don't believe in You?

428
00:24:17.959 --> 00:24:19.824
l haven't incurred any loss.

429
00:24:23.924 --> 00:24:25.289
Look.

430
00:24:28.624 --> 00:24:30.592
What's he doing?
- What..

431
00:24:30.923 --> 00:24:32.823
Everything's lost, Kanji.

432
00:24:33.590 --> 00:24:36.388
Only thing left is this Godrej safe.

433
00:25:01.219 --> 00:25:02.379
Rolex.

434
00:25:04.551 --> 00:25:06.280
lt's a Rolex.
- Nah.

435
00:25:07.785 --> 00:25:11.186
Mr. Dinesh. lsn't that
a Rolex watch you're wearing?

436
00:25:13.717 --> 00:25:15.241
Must be worth 1.5 -2 lakhs.

437
00:25:15.617 --> 00:25:16.845
lt's worth 10.

438
00:25:19.282 --> 00:25:20.544
Mr. Kanji.

439
00:25:20.783 --> 00:25:23.251
l am sure you read the
terms and conditions..

440
00:25:23.316 --> 00:25:24.806
..before reading the policy.

441
00:25:25.515 --> 00:25:26.709
Not at all, sir.

442
00:25:26.782 --> 00:25:30.479
Your officer asked me to
sign at the places marked..

443
00:25:30.547 --> 00:25:31.707
..and l did so.

444
00:25:32.181 --> 00:25:33.580
How irresponsible you are.

445
00:25:34.681 --> 00:25:35.443
What happened, sir?

446
00:25:35.514 --> 00:25:36.879
Your policy insures you against..

447
00:25:37.680 --> 00:25:42.811
..accidents like theft, fire, fraud.

448
00:25:42.879 --> 00:25:44.676
Right. That's what we opted for.

449
00:25:44.912 --> 00:25:46.573
But not against Act of God.

450
00:25:47.212 --> 00:25:48.372
Act of God?

451
00:25:50.178 --> 00:25:51.770
See, it's written here clearly.

452
00:25:51.845 --> 00:25:52.834
Conditions apply.

453
00:25:53.177 --> 00:25:56.669
My glasses.. - ln the event of
loss or damage to the property..

454
00:25:57.244 --> 00:26:00.304
..the insurance company
is not liable to pay..

455
00:26:01.176 --> 00:26:06.341
..any amount if the damage
is caused by act of God.

456
00:26:06.676 --> 00:26:09.338
And here are your signatures.

457
00:26:10.375 --> 00:26:13.344
lt's written in such small letters.

458
00:26:13.408 --> 00:26:14.807
And nobody reads that.

459
00:26:15.408 --> 00:26:17.137
What is 'Act of God'?

460
00:26:17.374 --> 00:26:20.138
lncidents that are
not caused by humans.

461
00:26:20.674 --> 00:26:24.610
Like?
- Like earthquake, Tsunami, Thunder.

462
00:26:25.372 --> 00:26:28.136
You cannot claim
insurance in such cases.

463
00:26:28.272 --> 00:26:30.103
Because these are natural calamities.

464
00:26:30.139 --> 00:26:31.436
But l don't believe in God.

465
00:26:31.505 --> 00:26:32.665
Tell him.

466
00:26:33.205 --> 00:26:35.196
l don't care if you do or don't.

467
00:26:35.605 --> 00:26:37.129
You're signatures are right here.

468
00:26:38.138 --> 00:26:39.298
l am so sorry.

469
00:26:40.170 --> 00:26:41.637
Sorry? What sorry?

470
00:26:42.137 --> 00:26:43.161
Sir.

471
00:26:43.237 --> 00:26:45.432
Sir, l've invested my
entire earnings in the shop.

472
00:26:45.470 --> 00:26:46.596
Even my house is mortgaged.

473
00:26:46.670 --> 00:26:47.602
And you're saying sorry.

474
00:26:47.670 --> 00:26:50.332
l know, but your
claim cannot be approved.

475
00:26:50.736 --> 00:26:52.226
You may go now.

476
00:26:55.836 --> 00:27:00.330
No, sir. l won't leave
until my claim isn't approved.

477
00:27:01.634 --> 00:27:03.124
Security.

478
00:27:03.700 --> 00:27:04.758
Sir..

479
00:27:05.034 --> 00:27:06.058
Sir, why are you calling security?

480
00:27:06.134 --> 00:27:08.659
l'm talking to you decently.
- Yes, sir.

481
00:27:08.734 --> 00:27:10.361
Take him away, please.
- Why call the security..

482
00:27:10.433 --> 00:27:12.162
Come on.
- Just a minute.

483
00:27:12.233 --> 00:27:13.359
Just a minute.

484
00:27:13.432 --> 00:27:14.364
Come on.

485
00:27:14.432 --> 00:27:16.229
You just know how to
swindle our money.

486
00:27:16.532 --> 00:27:17.396
Mind your language.

487
00:27:17.499 --> 00:27:19.524
You should be publicly beaten.

488
00:27:19.598 --> 00:27:20.724
Throw him out.

489
00:27:21.032 --> 00:27:22.124
Get out! Get out!

490
00:27:23.731 --> 00:27:27.633
You get this for
2000 in the flea market.

491
00:27:30.230 --> 00:27:31.527
Don't you understand?

492
00:27:31.596 --> 00:27:32.722
lt's Act of God.

493
00:27:33.197 --> 00:27:34.221
You want money, don't you?

494
00:27:34.262 --> 00:27:35.729
Go and ask God. Take him away.

495
00:27:36.029 --> 00:27:37.087
Act of God.

496
00:27:38.562 --> 00:27:41.156
Just a second. Just a second.

497
00:27:41.228 --> 00:27:42.525
Leave me.

498
00:27:43.228 --> 00:27:44.627
Act of God.

499
00:27:45.361 --> 00:27:47.522
So, you believe in God.
- Yes.

500
00:27:48.194 --> 00:27:51.220
You believe that God
is present everywhere.

501
00:27:51.626 --> 00:27:54.686
ln him, him, that madam, him.

502
00:27:55.259 --> 00:27:56.624
God dwells in everyone.
- Yes.

503
00:27:56.660 --> 00:27:57.752
And me?

504
00:27:58.259 --> 00:28:00.523
Mr. Dinesh, you believe
that God dwells in me too.

505
00:28:02.158 --> 00:28:03.022
Yes.

506
00:28:03.092 --> 00:28:04.116
Thank you.

507
00:28:04.192 --> 00:28:05.591
Act of God. l didn't do it.

508
00:28:05.658 --> 00:28:06.989
God did. lt's 'Act of God'.

509
00:28:07.624 --> 00:28:09.455
God slapped him again.

510
00:28:09.524 --> 00:28:10.616
l didn't do it.

511
00:28:14.390 --> 00:28:15.652
And now God will shoot you..

512
00:28:15.956 --> 00:28:16.980
And you will die.

513
00:28:17.023 --> 00:28:18.684
Later, will your
family get the claim..

514
00:28:18.989 --> 00:28:20.479
..or will that be
'Act of God' as well?

515
00:28:21.023 --> 00:28:22.388
Tell me.
- No.

516
00:28:22.456 --> 00:28:23.548
Kanji, what are you doing?

517
00:28:23.622 --> 00:28:25.419
Why are you scared? Take the gun.

518
00:28:25.489 --> 00:28:28.515
Get down now, come on.

