553
00:30:35.903 --> 00:30:36.870
Four times.

554
00:30:36.903 --> 00:30:39.929
And people will
construct a temple there as well.

555
00:30:40.135 --> 00:30:41.466
lf anyone wants the
buy the land he can..

556
