All rise.

778
00:42:49.393 --> 00:42:51.054
Kanji, get up.

779
00:43:10.190 --> 00:43:12.249
Mr. Kanji Lalji Mehta.
- Yes, sir.

780
00:43:12.990 --> 00:43:16.289
We've been informed that
you'll defend your own case.

781
00:43:16.356 --> 00:43:17.618
Yes..

782
00:43:18.956 --> 00:43:20.981
l don't have any other option,
Your Honour.

783
00:43:22.156 --> 00:43:23.487
The other lawyers are scared.

784
00:43:23.555 --> 00:43:26.388
So, l'll have to defend this case..

785
00:43:26.455 --> 00:43:27.979
My lordship, this is
a baseless appeal.

786
00:43:28.955 --> 00:43:30.149
A publicity stunt.

787
00:43:30.554 --> 00:43:32.988
There's no cause of action
that can be proved in court.

788
00:43:33.987 --> 00:43:38.014
So l suggest, under
order 7 rule no.11..

789
00:43:38.186 --> 00:43:39.585
..of the code of civil procedure.

790
00:43:40.119 --> 00:43:42.178
This case be straightaway dismissed..

791
00:43:42.485 --> 00:43:44.214
..for out of cause action.

792
00:43:46.218 --> 00:43:49.187
Your Honour, my
English isn't that good..

793
00:43:49.252 --> 00:43:52.221
..but l do
understand that he's asking..

794
00:43:52.284 --> 00:43:54.115
..to shut down this case immediately.

795
00:43:54.184 --> 00:43:55.583
Right? You're right.

796
00:43:56.217 --> 00:43:58.242
l don't want to get into
this hassle in the first place.

797
00:43:58.584 --> 00:44:00.347
l'm a Gujarati, businessman.

798
00:44:01.083 --> 00:44:03.950
Whether the Lord exists or not,
doesn't make a difference to me.

799
00:44:04.016 --> 00:44:05.381
The insurance people said that..

800
00:44:05.449 --> 00:44:07.349
..God has razed down my shop.

801
00:44:07.416 --> 00:44:09.475
Or, he's the One behind
your shop's destruction.

802
00:44:09.548 --> 00:44:11.880
So, l said fine. Ask God
to compensate for my losses.

803
00:44:11.915 --> 00:44:12.609
Case closed.

804
00:44:12.914 --> 00:44:14.575
But why will God raze down your shop?

805
00:44:17.014 --> 00:44:17.981
Fool!

806
00:44:18.014 --> 00:44:19.208
Please.

807
00:44:19.314 --> 00:44:22.078
Please come to the
witness box and speak.

808
00:44:27.580 --> 00:44:30.140
May Lord forgive his naiveness.

809
00:44:31.612 --> 00:44:34.206
May Lord forgive his naiveness.

810
00:44:35.111 --> 00:44:37.875
May Lord forgive his naiveness.

811
00:44:38.045 --> 00:44:39.979
Why will God raze down my shop?

812
00:44:40.377 --> 00:44:43.904
Exactly,
why will God raze down my shop?

813
00:44:44.343 --> 00:44:46.868
He has other important things to do.

814
00:44:47.343 --> 00:44:50.107
So, tell the
insurance company to pay me.

815
00:44:50.542 --> 00:44:51.566
End of matter.

816
00:44:51.876 --> 00:44:53.935
Why will the
insurance company pay you?

817
00:44:54.108 --> 00:44:55.905
You've agreed to the
terms and conditions..

818
00:44:55.975 --> 00:44:57.067
..of the insurance company.

819
00:44:57.374 --> 00:44:58.272
Exhibit no.1, sir.

820
00:44:58.341 --> 00:45:01.003
Right. Then God will
have to compensate for it.

821
00:45:01.840 --> 00:45:04.172
Call upon, Lord Ram, Shiva, Ganpati..

822
00:45:04.240 --> 00:45:05.832
..Whoever you get along better with.

823
00:45:05.907 --> 00:45:08.967
Do some of your hocus-pocus, or..
- Fool!

824
00:45:10.406 --> 00:45:13.204
The only way to find
God is through salvation.

825
00:45:14.072 --> 00:45:16.905
God won't descend down on earth..

826
00:45:16.972 --> 00:45:18.837
..for a ordinary man like you.

827
00:45:19.872 --> 00:45:21.965
He would only if He exists.

828
00:45:23.504 --> 00:45:27.406
You're turnover is in millions,
and this is a small settlement.

829
00:45:27.470 --> 00:45:28.300
Just say yes.

830
00:45:28.370 --> 00:45:31.498
l will even give you
cash discount. Really.

831
00:45:34.136 --> 00:45:35.501
l object, Your Honour.

832
00:45:36.969 --> 00:45:41.099
Mr. Kanji is calling
service to God a business.

833
00:45:41.168 --> 00:45:44.365
Of course it's business.

834
00:45:45.135 --> 00:45:46.932
Take a visit to any religious place.

835
00:45:47.000 --> 00:45:48.831
First you've to pay for parking.

836
00:45:48.900 --> 00:45:51.994
Then, pay for standing
in the smaller queue.

837
00:45:52.067 --> 00:45:55.002
Then pay for the flowers,
blanket, candle.

838
00:45:55.133 --> 00:45:57.363
And the donation box is
kept right before the idol.

839
00:45:57.432 --> 00:45:59.297
As soon as you bow down,
you've to put something in it.

840
00:45:59.365 --> 00:46:02.459
And they even charge
for the offerings of God.

841
00:46:03.098 --> 00:46:07.091
Just like we're charged for
seeing wax statues in the museum.

842
00:46:07.164 --> 00:46:10.759
Similarly, they charge us for
seeing the stone idols in temples.

843
00:46:11.931 --> 00:46:13.762
And the priests have salaries as well.

844
00:46:13.830 --> 00:46:15.161
His is less, and his is more.

845
00:46:15.230 --> 00:46:17.198
And you even have income tax benefits.

846
00:46:17.396 --> 00:46:18.863
Right?

847
00:46:19.195 --> 00:46:20.890
So, where's the service?

848
00:46:20.929 --> 00:46:24.865
And, Your Honour, there's
never recession in this business.

849
00:46:24.929 --> 00:46:25.793
No.

850
00:46:25.862 --> 00:46:28.023
ln fact, they do better
business during recession.

851
00:46:28.094 --> 00:46:30.062
''Oh, God! Oh my, God!''

852
00:46:30.460 --> 00:46:31.791
Relax.

853
00:46:31.861 --> 00:46:33.453
Consider that it is a business.

854
00:46:33.993 --> 00:46:35.324
Still, why are you
asking them for compensation?

855
00:46:36.160 --> 00:46:37.457
You pay premiums for your insurance..

856
00:46:37.760 --> 00:46:39.193
..so you can ask
them for a compensation.

857
00:46:39.359 --> 00:46:40.951
But why will the temple pay you?

858
00:46:41.792 --> 00:46:45.819
Because...l've paid premiums
in their temples as well. - What?

859
00:46:46.091 --> 00:46:47.183
What nonsense?

860
00:46:47.858 --> 00:46:50.349
l knew you won't believe me..

861
00:46:50.425 --> 00:46:54.020
..so l have brought
all the proofs along.

862
00:46:54.224 --> 00:46:57.193
Look. These are the
receipts of the premium..

863
00:46:57.257 --> 00:46:59.691
..l've been paying
for the last 18 years.

864
00:47:00.189 --> 00:47:01.747
On my wife's advice.

865
00:47:01.923 --> 00:47:02.912
Look.

866
00:47:02.989 --> 00:47:05.753
My first premium was for 1501 rupees..

867
00:47:06.122 --> 00:47:09.387
There's a well-known temple
in the South. l paid it there.

868
00:47:11.022 --> 00:47:14.048
Then, l've been paying
1000 rupees every year..

869
00:47:14.121 --> 00:47:15.816
..at Lord Ganesha's stall.

870
00:47:15.887 --> 00:47:17.946
lt's called a mandap.

871
00:47:18.787 --> 00:47:22.848
And, your honour, my
mother-in-law used to be very sick.

872
00:47:22.920 --> 00:47:26.754
So, the temple
authorities said, ''Pay us 11,000..''

873
00:47:26.953 --> 00:47:28.716
''..perform a veneration
and watch the miracle''.

874
00:47:29.119 --> 00:47:31.383
We performed the veneration
and my mother-in-law passed away.

875
00:47:32.685 --> 00:47:34.880
That was a good thing,
but l also lost 11,000.

876
00:47:35.685 --> 00:47:37.983
And they didn't refund a single rupee.

877
00:47:38.951 --> 00:47:41.010
And then, donation at the mosque..

878
00:47:41.083 --> 00:47:44.211
..blanket at the shrine,
candle at church, alms for beggar..

879
00:47:44.284 --> 00:47:46.752
..incense sticks,
veil for Mother Goddess.

880
00:47:47.049 --> 00:47:50.849
ln total l've paid around 10
lakhs in all these stores.

881
00:47:50.916 --> 00:47:52.349
Enough!

882
00:47:52.882 --> 00:47:54.042
Enough!

883
00:47:55.848 --> 00:47:57.839
Don't call it a store.

884
00:47:58.181 --> 00:47:59.910
lt's called a temple.

885
00:48:01.614 --> 00:48:04.583
And people donate
willingly at the temple..

886
00:48:04.613 --> 00:48:07.605
..for the peace and
prosperity of their family.

887
00:48:07.780 --> 00:48:09.645
Even l gave this amount..

888
00:48:09.712 --> 00:48:11.839
..for the peace and
prosperity of my family.

889
00:48:12.179 --> 00:48:14.010
And not for fun.

890
00:48:14.779 --> 00:48:17.304
But your God snatched
all the peace from my life.

891
00:48:17.611 --> 00:48:19.602
Because only God can
cause earthquakes.

892
00:48:19.978 --> 00:48:21.309
Humans cannot do it.

893
00:48:21.745 --> 00:48:24.612
So tell me, don't l've a right
to ask God for compensation?

894
00:48:24.677 --> 00:48:25.769
Mr. Kanji.

895
00:48:26.077 --> 00:48:27.635
You've a tiff with God, don't you?
- Yes.

896
00:48:28.043 --> 00:48:29.670
So why don't you ask Him
directly for compensation?

897
00:48:29.743 --> 00:48:30.869
Why are you asking the temples?

898
00:48:32.576 --> 00:48:37.570
Which company supplies
electricity to your home?

899
00:48:38.608 --> 00:48:39.632
Reliance.
- Reliance.

900
00:48:39.708 --> 00:48:42.006
So if there's an
electricity problem in your home..

901
00:48:42.074 --> 00:48:44.201
..you will call up the
Reliance office, won't you?

902
00:48:44.707 --> 00:48:46.641
You won't call Anil Ambani directly.

903
00:48:47.908 --> 00:48:51.071
Mr. Anil, we've a electricity problem.

904
00:48:52.606 --> 00:48:53.800
Silence.

905
00:48:54.073 --> 00:48:55.267
What do you mean?

906
00:48:55.972 --> 00:48:56.996
What do you mean?

907
00:48:57.572 --> 00:49:02.600
These priests, the saints
are officers of God. - No.

908
00:49:02.672 --> 00:49:04.230
They aren't officers.

909
00:49:04.638 --> 00:49:06.538
Officers are educated people.

910
00:49:07.038 --> 00:49:09.199
They are...

911
00:49:09.604 --> 00:49:11.538
They are salesmen, Your Honour.

912
00:49:13.570 --> 00:49:15.060
They are collection agents..

913
00:49:15.136 --> 00:49:17.001
..because they own God's franchise.

914
00:49:17.069 --> 00:49:18.696
Your Honour.

915
00:49:21.702 --> 00:49:23.636
This man's an atheist.

916
00:49:25.501 --> 00:49:29.665
He doesn't know what he's saying.

917
00:49:31.634 --> 00:49:34.068
But, we are saints.

918
00:49:34.767 --> 00:49:35.961
We will forgive him.

919
00:49:37.233 --> 00:49:42.762
But the world will never
forgive him for this grave sin.

920
00:49:42.799 --> 00:49:45.131
You won't be able to set
foot out of your house..

921
00:49:45.199 --> 00:49:47.599
..if you say anything else.

922
00:49:47.865 --> 00:49:51.232
ls that your concern for me..

923
00:49:51.498 --> 00:49:53.728
..or are you threatening
me in front of the judge?

924
00:49:55.731 --> 00:49:58.757
We...are concerned for you.

925
00:49:58.830 --> 00:50:00.889
They pay me up quickly.
End this matter.

926
00:50:00.963 --> 00:50:02.954
My lord, this is enough.

927
00:50:03.129 --> 00:50:05.029
The donation receipts,
the submissions.

928
00:50:05.196 --> 00:50:08.029
There's no agency agreement
between God and my clients.

929
00:50:09.061 --> 00:50:10.790
Kanji is saying baseless things.

930
00:50:11.661 --> 00:50:14.630
We cannot file a case
against God for such a small thing.

931
00:50:14.694 --> 00:50:15.752
Small?

932
00:50:16.894 --> 00:50:18.555
My lord, this isn't small issue.

933
00:50:19.094 --> 00:50:20.823
That shop means everything to me.

934
00:50:21.493 --> 00:50:22.585
My means of earning.

935
00:50:22.660 --> 00:50:24.525
The only way to support my family.

936
00:50:25.226 --> 00:50:28.923
And l built that shop with hard work.

937
00:50:29.659 --> 00:50:32.150
Now, it's just a piece of land.

938
00:50:32.558 --> 00:50:34.583
And no one's ready
to buy that as well.

939
00:50:35.058 --> 00:50:37.959
These people say,
''Donate with faith..''

940
00:50:38.024 --> 00:50:39.821
''..and you'll never be wronged''.

941
00:50:40.924 --> 00:50:43.893
And the insurance people say
''Pay your premiums on time..''

942
00:50:43.956 --> 00:50:45.150
''..we're there in
your troubled times''.

943
00:50:45.623 --> 00:50:48.683
l gave donations and
also paid my premiums.

944
00:50:48.756 --> 00:50:50.724
But none of them are
willing to help me.

945
00:50:51.523 --> 00:50:53.184
l am an ordinary human.

946
00:50:53.488 --> 00:50:54.887
A middle-class man.

947
00:50:55.121 --> 00:50:56.213
My family, my wife and children..

948
00:50:56.488 --> 00:50:57.546
..will be forced to live on streets.

949
00:50:58.488 --> 00:50:59.648
No, my lord.

950
00:50:59.721 --> 00:51:01.450
You'll have to give me a chance..

951
00:51:01.521 --> 00:51:03.011
..to defend my case in this court.

952
00:51:03.587 --> 00:51:06.579
And the constituency of
lndia gives me the right..

953
00:51:06.653 --> 00:51:08.587
..to voice my plea in this court.

954
00:51:09.586 --> 00:51:11.144
So please, my lord.

955
00:51:20.484 --> 00:51:26.047
One crore is a big amount
for a middle-class businessman.

956
00:51:26.950 --> 00:51:29.919
And especially, when it's
a question of his survival.

957
00:51:31.049 --> 00:51:38.012
So, the court accepts
Kanji Lalji Mehta's case.

958
00:51:44.047 --> 00:51:45.514
Silence.

959
00:51:47.580 --> 00:51:49.571
And only after carefully examining..

960
00:51:50.080 --> 00:51:51.775
..all the evidences and arguments..

961
00:51:51.846 --> 00:51:53.575
..the court will give
its verdict, whether..

962
00:51:53.646 --> 00:51:56.945
..Mr. Mr. Kanji Lal will
get his compensation or not.

963
00:51:57.579 --> 00:51:59.479
And if he does, then who will pay him?

964
00:52:00.379 --> 00:52:03.439
The insurance company or, the temple.

965
00:52:03.978 --> 00:52:05.843
The court's adjourned for the day.

966
00:52:13.676 --> 00:52:15.576
Wait. Wait.

967
00:52:16.710 --> 00:52:20.441
You can perform all
the veneration you want..

968
00:52:20.742 --> 00:52:23.404
..and ring those bells
as many times you wish.

969
00:52:24.475 --> 00:52:27.376
Your God razed down my shop.

970
00:52:27.975 --> 00:52:31.502
And now, l will alone
shut down all his shops..

971
00:52:31.574 --> 00:52:35.908
..or my name isn't Kanji Lalji Mehta.

972
00:52:36.473 --> 00:52:39.909
And this isn't my concern for you.

973
00:52:40.506 --> 00:52:42.599
lt's a direct warning.

974
00:52:42.973 --> 00:52:44.406
Yes.

975
00:53:27.433 --> 00:53:32.496
You're safe here,
it's a government property.

976
00:53:33.698 --> 00:53:35.632
But how will you escape them?

977
00:53:45.296 --> 00:53:46.854
Down with..
- Kanji!

978
00:53:46.929 --> 00:53:48.453
Down with..
- Kanji!

979
00:53:48.529 --> 00:53:49.962
Down with..
- Kanji!

980
00:53:50.295 --> 00:53:51.728
Down with..
- Kanji!

981
00:53:51.796 --> 00:53:53.593
Down with..
- Kanji!

982
00:53:53.661 --> 00:53:55.424
Down with..
- Kanji!

983
00:53:55.495 --> 00:53:57.395
Down with..
- Kanji!

984
00:53:57.628 --> 00:54:01.189
Sir. The case has been accepted.

985
00:54:01.228 --> 00:54:02.752
l'm worried about
Sushila and the children.

986
00:54:02.827 --> 00:54:03.725
l'll take a cab, you go.

987
00:54:03.794 --> 00:54:05.762
But how can l leave you alone.

988
00:54:05.826 --> 00:54:08.226
l'm going to the police station,
for protection.

989
00:54:08.260 --> 00:54:09.591
Drop her home as well. Go.

990
00:54:10.259 --> 00:54:11.226
Be careful, dear.

991
00:54:11.292 --> 00:54:13.192
Go, go, go.

992
00:54:13.692 --> 00:54:15.216
Are the boys ready?

993
00:54:18.625 --> 00:54:19.751
Remember.

994
00:54:20.724 --> 00:54:24.182
Kanji shouldn't get to
see daylight. That's it.

995
00:54:26.624 --> 00:54:27.750
There he is.

996
00:54:28.656 --> 00:54:31.181
Catch him, beat him. Don't let him go.

997
00:54:34.189 --> 00:54:35.816
Wait, where are you running to?

998
00:54:53.420 --> 00:54:55.445
He's hiding there. Catch him.

999
00:54:55.519 --> 00:54:57.453
There he goes. Catch him.

1000
00:54:58.385 --> 00:54:59.784
Don't let him go.

1001
00:55:08.484 --> 00:55:10.418
''Go...go...go...Govinda.''

1002
00:55:11.484 --> 00:55:14.112
''Here comes Govinda...''

1003
00:55:15.683 --> 00:55:17.742
''Go...go...go...Govinda.''

1004
00:55:19.549 --> 00:55:20.777
Don't let him go, catch him.

1005
00:55:23.115 --> 00:55:25.140
''Go...go...go...Govinda.''

1006
00:55:27.281 --> 00:55:28.373
Go that way.

1007
00:55:30.280 --> 00:55:32.339
''Go...go...go...Govinda.''

1008
00:55:49.611 --> 00:55:51.135
Let's sit down and talk.

1009
00:55:51.211 --> 00:55:52.769
All l did was file a case.

1010
00:55:53.244 --> 00:55:55.542
lf you try to talk
they'll cut you in half.

1011
00:55:55.743 --> 00:55:57.108
Look behind.

1012
00:55:57.177 --> 00:55:58.439
Catch him.

1013
00:55:58.510 --> 00:56:00.034
Faster!

1014
00:56:03.542 --> 00:56:04.531
Who are you?

1015
00:56:04.609 --> 00:56:06.338
Krishna Vasudev Yadav.

1016
00:56:06.576 --> 00:56:07.543
What?

1017
00:56:07.609 --> 00:56:10.544
Krishna Vasudev Yadav from Gokul.

1018
00:56:11.241 --> 00:56:12.572
So you're from UP.

1019
00:56:13.074 --> 00:56:15.474
You can call me Kanhaiyya.

1020
00:56:15.574 --> 00:56:16.598
Catch him.

1021
00:56:26.339 --> 00:56:28.466
Careful. Careful.

1022
00:56:29.505 --> 00:56:31.700
Careful, slow down.

1023
00:56:32.371 --> 00:56:33.395
Slow down.

1024
00:56:45.203 --> 00:56:47.137
Are you a man or a stuntman?

1025
00:56:47.436 --> 00:56:49.199
You can call me a stuntman as well.

1026
00:56:49.569 --> 00:56:52.197
But people call my stunts a miracle.

1027
00:56:52.702 --> 00:56:54.670
Miracle.
- Hold on.

1028
00:56:55.268 --> 00:56:57.202
You aren't wearing a helmet either.

1029
00:56:57.401 --> 00:56:58.561
There he is.

1030
00:57:06.166 --> 00:57:07.997
Don't go this way, go that way.

1031
00:57:09.699 --> 00:57:12.293
Down, down, down, drive on the road.

1032
00:57:25.263 --> 00:57:27.993
Faster!
- ''Go...go...go...Govinda.''

1033
00:57:30.197 --> 00:57:31.494
That was a narrow escape.

1034
00:57:32.196 --> 00:57:34.255
Now, take me to Brahmanwadi.

1035
00:57:35.596 --> 00:57:41.057
Go straight then take a left,
then right and another left.

1036
00:57:41.528 --> 00:57:42.688
And you'll be home, go on.

1037
00:57:43.462 --> 00:57:45.953
You brought me this far,
so drop me home as well.

1038
00:57:45.994 --> 00:57:47.359
My job's to show the way..

1039
00:57:47.427 --> 00:57:49.088
..it's your job to
get to the destination.

1040
00:57:51.593 --> 00:57:52.617
Fine.

1041
00:57:54.560 --> 00:57:56.187
Keep it. Thank you so much.

1042
00:57:56.359 --> 00:57:58.190
You're so kind.
- Thank you.

1043
00:57:58.358 --> 00:58:00.918
Take care. ''Go...go...go...Govinda.''

1044
00:58:10.357 --> 00:58:13.155
Papa!
- Sushila.

1045
00:58:13.590 --> 00:58:14.887
ls everything fine?

1046
00:58:15.923 --> 00:58:17.515
Go up and take a look in
the house, you'll know.

1047
00:58:18.223 --> 00:58:19.622
Thankfully we survived, otherwise..

1048
00:58:19.956 --> 00:58:21.446
No, l'll talk to the police.

1049
00:58:21.522 --> 00:58:22.318
Don't worry.

1050
00:58:22.389 --> 00:58:27.122
They hurled stones and
acid bottles in our house.

1051
00:58:27.887 --> 00:58:29.912
l don't care lf l die.

1052
00:58:29.987 --> 00:58:31.011
But the children.

1053
00:58:31.987 --> 00:58:34.547
lf Jigna would've
been hit by that acid..

1054
00:58:34.620 --> 00:58:36.212
l won't let anything happen to them.

1055
00:58:36.287 --> 00:58:37.276
l am their father. Please.

1056
00:58:37.353 --> 00:58:38.945
So, understand the duties of a father.

1057
00:58:39.020 --> 00:58:40.920
Withdraw the case.
- You're a fool.

1058
00:58:41.586 --> 00:58:42.883
l'm about to lose my house.

1059
00:58:45.318 --> 00:58:46.512
Where will we stay?

1060
00:58:47.084 --> 00:58:49.382
On the streets, or in their house?

1061
00:58:50.452 --> 00:58:52.010
Do we have any other option?

1062
00:58:52.118 --> 00:58:53.016
Why don't you understand?

1063
00:58:53.118 --> 00:58:54.881
Come on, Jigna. Sit in the car.

1064
00:58:55.250 --> 00:58:57.377
Come.
- He's made a mess of things.

1065
00:58:57.451 --> 00:58:59.112
l won't leave papa.

1066
00:59:00.316 --> 00:59:01.840
l'll slap you if you refuse.
- No, mother.

1067
00:59:01.916 --> 00:59:03.816
Come on, sit inside.

1068
00:59:06.482 --> 00:59:07.506
Please..

1069
00:59:52.606 --> 00:59:53.664
Hello.

1070
00:59:54.539 --> 00:59:55.597
Hello.

1071
00:59:56.406 --> 00:59:58.306
Who is it?
- Bhagwan (God).

1072
00:59:58.505 --> 00:59:59.995
What?

1073
01:00:00.271 --> 01:00:02.501
lf you were a Muslim,
l would've said Allah.

1074
01:00:03.071 --> 01:00:05.096
lf you were a Christian,
then Jesus Christ.

1075
01:00:05.338 --> 01:00:07.738
You're a Hindu, so Krishna.

1076
01:00:13.603 --> 01:00:15.002
You, here?

1077
01:00:16.369 --> 01:00:19.668
You're an excellent stuntman, really.

1078
01:00:19.735 --> 01:00:20.565
Very good.

1079
01:00:20.635 --> 01:00:22.626
l'm sure you're
acting is decent as well.

1080
01:00:23.301 --> 01:00:26.134
Why don't you approach
some television channel?

1081
01:00:26.201 --> 01:00:30.661
They keep remaking
Ramayan and Mahabharat.

1082
01:00:31.234 --> 01:00:32.599
Krishna.

1083
01:00:34.400 --> 01:00:36.493
Suited-booted Krishna.

1084
01:00:37.099 --> 01:00:38.532
Here to teach me a lesson.

1085
01:00:39.966 --> 01:00:41.524
Look.

1086
01:00:42.098 --> 01:00:43.929
Look there.

1087
01:00:44.065 --> 01:00:45.965
Gods are bare-bodied.

1088
01:00:46.065 --> 01:00:47.293
Like this.

1089
01:00:47.931 --> 01:00:50.229
They're never fully covered.

1090
01:00:51.498 --> 01:00:53.227
That's your wedding photo, right?
- Yes.

1091
01:00:53.296 --> 01:00:54.524
Wearing that traditional attire.

1092
01:00:54.563 --> 01:00:56.963
So, did you only wear
a traditional attire..

1093
01:00:57.030 --> 01:00:58.190
..since your wedding?

1094
01:00:58.263 --> 01:00:59.628
No, right?
- No.

1095
01:01:00.163 --> 01:01:03.098
See. That's our older image.

1096
01:01:03.362 --> 01:01:05.557
Conch in one hand, mace in the other.

1097
01:01:05.628 --> 01:01:07.323
Where are yours?

1098
01:01:07.395 --> 01:01:10.455
lf l keep holding them all day,
won't my arms hurt?

1099
01:01:13.261 --> 01:01:14.421
Think.

1100
01:01:14.494 --> 01:01:17.292
Actually, our latest photos
haven't been updated on Facebook.

1101
01:01:17.926 --> 01:01:19.359
People still use the
older ones, and we let them.

1102
01:01:19.426 --> 01:01:20.393
We don't have a problem.

1103
01:01:20.459 --> 01:01:22.393
- Let them. - That's enough.

1104
01:01:22.593 --> 01:01:25.027
You're boring me now. Get out, leave.

1105
01:01:27.959 --> 01:01:29.324
Mahadev!

1106
01:01:30.125 --> 01:01:34.494
- Mahadev! - Only you
can hear and see me.

1107
01:01:34.958 --> 01:01:36.926
Yes, coming. Coming.

1108
01:01:41.356 --> 01:01:42.323
Mahadev!

1109
01:01:42.356 --> 01:01:43.846
What happened? What happened, Kanji?

1110
01:01:44.390 --> 01:01:45.288
See him.

1111
01:01:45.323 --> 01:01:47.188
He calls himself God.

1112
01:01:48.089 --> 01:01:49.215
l can see him.

1113
01:01:49.455 --> 01:01:50.854
He can see you.

1114
01:01:50.921 --> 01:01:53.890
My name's Krishna, your new neighbour.

1115
01:01:54.554 --> 01:01:56.044
Neighbour?

1116
01:01:56.854 --> 01:01:58.014
Neighbour?

1117
01:01:58.054 --> 01:02:00.386
The person Kanji had
mortgaged his house to..

1118
01:02:00.453 --> 01:02:01.977
..has sold it to me.

1119
01:02:03.353 --> 01:02:04.547
Here are the documents.

1120
01:02:07.986 --> 01:02:11.478
And, Kanji bhai, sorry
for that joke about God.

1121
01:02:13.485 --> 01:02:14.952
What's this?

1122
01:02:15.284 --> 01:02:17.411
How can he sell my house to him?

1123
01:02:17.485 --> 01:02:19.350
l was about to pay him on time.

1124
01:02:19.418 --> 01:02:20.407
l already paid him.

1125
01:02:20.450 --> 01:02:21.849
This isn't done.

1126
01:02:21.951 --> 01:02:23.111
This is my house.
Nobody can just buy it.

1127
01:02:23.183 --> 01:02:25.515
Relax. Chill.

1128
01:02:26.117 --> 01:02:29.177
When you get your
compensation from God..

1129
01:02:29.249 --> 01:02:33.117
..you can repay me, l will leave.

1130
01:02:33.149 --> 01:02:36.141
And anyway, l always leave
after my project is over.

1131
01:02:36.215 --> 01:02:39.446
Why buy the house
when you want to leave?

1132
01:02:39.981 --> 01:02:41.073
Are you a agent?

1133
01:02:43.047 --> 01:02:44.446
l am not that low.

1134
01:02:44.847 --> 01:02:46.178
l've a consultancy firm.

1135
01:02:46.780 --> 01:02:48.873
l give advice to people.
- Advice.

1136
01:02:48.947 --> 01:02:50.938
Anyone who thinks of me.

1137
01:02:51.013 --> 01:02:52.810
Public service. Service open to all.

1138
01:02:53.246 --> 01:02:55.407
A solution to every problem.

1139
01:02:56.078 --> 01:02:58.444
Sometimes it gets slightly delayed.

1140
01:02:58.512 --> 01:03:00.309
But...l always get there on time.

1141
01:03:00.845 --> 01:03:02.142
There's delay but not denial.

1142
01:03:02.211 --> 01:03:04.338
Just like l came here,
to help Kanji bhai.

1143
01:03:05.011 --> 01:03:06.035
Help me?

1144
01:03:06.111 --> 01:03:07.373
l found out about your condition..

1145
01:03:07.443 --> 01:03:09.070
..only after l brought the house.

1146
01:03:10.076 --> 01:03:11.202
The court case, lost your shop..

1147
01:03:11.276 --> 01:03:12.470
..and your wife and children too.

1148
01:03:12.776 --> 01:03:14.801
Kanji bhai, don't worry.

1149
01:03:15.010 --> 01:03:16.238
You can stay here.

1150
01:03:17.109 --> 01:03:19.839
ln return,
l will only use your things.

1151
01:03:19.975 --> 01:03:21.772
Television, fridge, etcetera.

1152
01:03:25.475 --> 01:03:26.772
Fine, but remember..

1153
01:03:26.841 --> 01:03:28.900
..one day l will buy this
house back from you.

1154
01:03:29.041 --> 01:03:30.167
So be it!

1155
01:03:30.874 --> 01:03:32.364
l mean, l promise.

1156
01:03:33.906 --> 01:03:35.874
He's a nice man.
- Something you said.

1157
01:03:35.940 --> 01:03:37.908
No, just.. Cheers.

1158
01:03:39.705 --> 01:03:40.763
Calls himself God.

1159
01:03:40.839 --> 01:03:41.828
l think he's drunk.

1160
01:03:41.905 --> 01:03:45.966
Thank you, for letting
me stay in my own house.

1161
01:03:46.205 --> 01:03:47.695
Thank you so much.

1162
01:03:48.871 --> 01:03:50.031
Thank you.

1163
01:03:51.204 --> 01:03:53.764
l will sleep outside on the terrace.

1164
01:03:54.137 --> 01:03:55.729
And you can sleep wherever you want.

1165
01:03:55.770 --> 01:03:56.794
lt's your house.

1166
01:03:57.103 --> 01:03:58.730
Thank you. Goodnight.

1167
01:03:59.036 --> 01:04:01.095
And yes, the light
switch is at the back.

1168
01:04:01.203 --> 01:04:02.864
Switch off the lights
before you go to sleep.

1169
01:04:07.435 --> 01:04:08.925
Another power failure.

1170
01:04:10.234 --> 01:04:14.295
No. you switched it off.
- No, l didn't.

1171
01:04:14.368 --> 01:04:15.426
You're drunk.

1172
01:04:15.700 --> 01:04:16.860
So?

1173
01:04:19.166 --> 01:04:20.394
l see.

1174
01:04:31.698 --> 01:04:34.223
''Go...go...go...Govinda.''

1175
01:04:38.796 --> 01:04:41.356
''Go...go...go...Govinda.''

1176
01:04:46.029 --> 01:04:48.190
''Go...go...go...Govinda.''

1177
01:05:12.692 --> 01:05:15.160
Case on God admitted. Paper,
paper, paper.

1178
01:05:15.225 --> 01:05:16.954
High Court has put it's seal on it.

1179
01:05:23.657 --> 01:05:26.182
Through the notice prepared
by advocate Hanif Qureshi..

1180
01:05:26.256 --> 01:05:29.054
..Kanji Lalji Mehta's case
on God has been accepted.

1181
01:05:29.156 --> 01:05:30.248
l think he's mad.

1182
01:05:30.322 --> 01:05:31.653
Who is this guy?

1183
01:05:31.689 --> 01:05:32.781
Hey Jigna, what happened?

1184
01:05:39.221 --> 01:05:41.280
See, his wife ran away.

1185
01:05:41.654 --> 01:05:43.121
Who can live with that madman?

1186
01:05:43.188 --> 01:05:45.588
l don't even talk to him.

1187
01:05:45.620 --> 01:05:47.611
Or the Lord might punish us as well.

1188
01:05:52.586 --> 01:05:55.248
What a splendid bike.
- But, who is he?

1189
01:05:55.618 --> 01:05:57.142
l think he arrived just last night.

1190
01:05:59.251 --> 01:06:02.186
Who's playing this classical music?

1191
01:06:02.285 --> 01:06:06.915
l've heard that the new
guest is really handsome.

1192
01:06:06.984 --> 01:06:08.952
Don't l look handsome?

1193
01:06:09.683 --> 01:06:10.775
Get inside.

1194
01:06:17.849 --> 01:06:19.282
Hey, Hari Prasad.

1195
01:06:21.748 --> 01:06:23.045
Hey, Chaurasiya.

1196
01:06:23.781 --> 01:06:25.578
What's all this?

1197
01:06:26.114 --> 01:06:27.581
l was waking up the birds!

1198
01:06:27.614 --> 01:06:28.774
What? Who?

1199
01:06:28.847 --> 01:06:30.542
l was waking up the birds!

1200
01:06:30.814 --> 01:06:32.645
Practice. l was practising.

1201
01:06:32.980 --> 01:06:34.277
lt's a good thing to
do in the morning.

1202
01:06:34.580 --> 01:06:36.707
Don't do it.
Don't do all this in my house.

1203
01:06:38.913 --> 01:06:40.847
lt's your house you can
play anything you want.

1204
01:06:41.512 --> 01:06:43.070
Good morning.
- What?

1205
01:06:43.179 --> 01:06:45.511
Not me, there's a lady in your house.

1206
01:06:46.611 --> 01:06:47.771
Hello.

1207
01:06:48.511 --> 01:06:49.637
Hello.

1208
01:06:49.677 --> 01:06:51.838
l brought breakfast.

1209
01:06:51.911 --> 01:06:54.038
l thought since sister-in-law isn't home,
so.. - No need.

1210
01:06:54.110 --> 01:06:55.805
l'll have bread and butter.

1211
01:06:58.209 --> 01:06:59.733
Where's the butter?

1212
01:07:00.643 --> 01:07:01.769
l ate it.

1213
01:07:05.009 --> 01:07:07.773
There was half a kilo of
butter in there, you ate it all.

1214
01:07:07.841 --> 01:07:10.002
lt's my favourite thing. So l ate it.

1215
01:07:10.175 --> 01:07:11.608
Tell me one thing.

1216
01:07:11.674 --> 01:07:13.574
Why do they make it so salty?

1217
01:07:14.074 --> 01:07:15.632
Just like his name.

1218
01:07:16.974 --> 01:07:18.100
Are you all alone?

1219
01:07:18.173 --> 01:07:19.868
Your wife?
- Of course.

1220
01:07:20.039 --> 01:07:21.506
Sixteen thousand..
- What?

1221
01:07:21.540 --> 01:07:22.564
She lives in Sholapur.

1222
01:07:24.206 --> 01:07:26.766
What did you hear?
- Sixteen thousand.

1223
01:07:27.072 --> 01:07:29.597
No, she lives in Sholapur.

1224
01:07:29.838 --> 01:07:31.203
He can't handle one..

1225
01:07:31.504 --> 01:07:32.937
..how can l have sixteen thousand.

1226
01:07:33.004 --> 01:07:35.199
Please go. He's a big liar.

1227
01:07:35.504 --> 01:07:36.630
He was boring me yesterday.

1228
01:07:36.704 --> 01:07:38.934
- Please go.
- Give it.

1229
01:07:41.003 --> 01:07:42.971
lf you eat all that
you'll get a stomach ache.

1230
01:07:43.036 --> 01:07:44.731
First half a kilo of
butter and now this.

1231
01:07:45.135 --> 01:07:46.625
l'll be fine.

1232
01:07:49.501 --> 01:07:51.765
- Hello.
- Sir, l'm speaking from ABP News.

1233
01:07:51.868 --> 01:07:53.768
l am standing below your house.

1234
01:07:54.968 --> 01:07:56.401
Sir.

1235
01:07:56.667 --> 01:07:59.568
Look, l don't want to be
a piece of news for you.

1236
01:08:00.067 --> 01:08:01.932
And don't call me again.

1237
01:08:02.633 --> 01:08:04.533
Sir, just one interview.

1238
01:08:04.733 --> 01:08:09.636
Since he filed a case
against God, he's become alone.

1239
01:08:11.999 --> 01:08:13.728
One has to tread on such a path alone.

1240
01:08:14.864 --> 01:08:17.765
Let's see how far our friend goes.

1241
01:08:20.997 --> 01:08:22.658
The advocate who
prepared Kanji's notice.

1242
01:08:22.730 --> 01:08:24.425
He lives that way.

1243
01:08:24.463 --> 01:08:26.431
Excuse me, advocate Hanif Qureshi.

1244
01:08:26.730 --> 01:08:28.027
He lives right there.

1245
01:08:28.096 --> 01:08:30.587
Where does advocate
Hanif Qureshi live?

1246
01:08:30.662 --> 01:08:31.993
He lives right there.

1247
01:08:32.395 --> 01:08:34.454
Advocate Hanif Qureshi lives there.

1248
01:08:40.761 --> 01:08:43.730
155 letters, and calls too.

1249
01:08:44.393 --> 01:08:47.726
Bhuj, Latur, Vishakapatnam.

1250
01:08:48.393 --> 01:08:51.362
Their claims haven't been approved..

1251
01:08:51.426 --> 01:08:54.589
..for the past few years due to
'Act of God'.

1252
01:08:55.758 --> 01:08:59.819
All they all want you
to defend their cases.

1253
01:09:00.792 --> 01:09:05.661
Son, l've lost my house
in the earthquake.

1254
01:09:07.557 --> 01:09:12.051
My son and his wife died too.

1255
01:09:16.423 --> 01:09:17.685
This is my grandson.

1256
01:09:18.422 --> 01:09:20.890
His cancer needs to be operated.

1257
01:09:21.555 --> 01:09:25.821
lf l get the insurance money,
everything will be alright.

1258
01:09:26.788 --> 01:09:28.619
This is Aslam.

1259
01:09:28.654 --> 01:09:29.848
Hello.
- Hello.

1260
01:09:29.920 --> 01:09:31.945
He lost everything in the Tsunami.

1261
01:09:32.787 --> 01:09:37.053
He lost all the money he had
saved for his sister's marriage.

1262
01:09:38.986 --> 01:09:40.419
So you file a case too.

1263
01:09:40.485 --> 01:09:41.884
l'll be cast out..

1264
01:09:41.952 --> 01:09:45.945
..if l go against the
priest or community.

1265
01:09:46.018 --> 01:09:48.543
Look, Aslam. You
aren't going against anyone.

1266
01:09:49.318 --> 01:09:53.516
Those who taught you religion,
taught you to pray..

1267
01:09:53.583 --> 01:09:57.883
..you're just questioning
them why Allah did this to you.

1268
01:09:58.849 --> 01:10:01.818
But, the priest..
- Aslam.

1269
01:10:02.416 --> 01:10:05.044
When you lose your home..

1270
01:10:05.815 --> 01:10:08.648
..will the priest let
you stay in his house?

1271
01:10:09.948 --> 01:10:14.408
Religion is for people,
people aren't made for religion.

1272
01:10:19.813 --> 01:10:23.943
Hanif, how long will it
take to ready their papers?

1273
01:10:24.612 --> 01:10:26.307
As long as it will take me to type.

1274
01:10:27.578 --> 01:10:28.909
Let's begin.

1275
01:10:50.608 --> 01:10:53.543
First one crore, and now
claims worth 400 crores.

1276
01:10:53.608 --> 01:10:54.802
Kanji Mehta!

1277
01:10:55.441 --> 01:10:56.931
Advocate Sardesai is caught between..

1278
01:10:57.241 --> 01:10:59.300
..the insurance company
and religious organizations.

1279
01:10:59.373 --> 01:11:01.671
For God's sake, prove that God exists.

1280
01:11:01.740 --> 01:11:03.867
And...and...make God pay all this!

1281
01:11:03.940 --> 01:11:07.432
The temples, mosques,
churches, they will pay everything.

1282
01:11:07.506 --> 01:11:08.700
Kanji.

1283
01:11:09.239 --> 01:11:10.900
Wasn't your fight with your God?

1284
01:11:10.972 --> 01:11:13.372
Silence please!
- So why call me here?

1285
01:11:13.605 --> 01:11:19.635
Priest, how can l say
which God of which religion..

1286
01:11:20.237 --> 01:11:23.604
..was behind this earthquake,
or that Tsunami?

1287
01:11:23.803 --> 01:11:25.532
That's your department.

1288
01:11:25.937 --> 01:11:29.304
Your Honour, they're in
constant touch with God.

1289
01:11:29.536 --> 01:11:31.231
They're always in contact.

1290
01:11:31.568 --> 01:11:35.436
Why don't you tell me
Who was responsible?

1291
01:11:35.502 --> 01:11:39.165
Why would our God harm
people of our own religion?

1292
01:11:39.401 --> 01:11:40.527
God will never do such a thing!

1293
01:11:40.601 --> 01:11:42.626
- Silence. - He loves his children!

1294
01:11:42.701 --> 01:11:44.896
Allah doesn't hate
his followers either!

1295
01:11:45.167 --> 01:11:46.759
- Relax. - Please be seated.

1296
01:11:49.366 --> 01:11:53.666
The court needs some time
to study all these cases.

1297
01:11:53.732 --> 01:11:58.533
Anyone related to this
case cannot leave the country.

1298
01:11:58.598 --> 01:11:59.622
What?

1299
01:11:59.765 --> 01:12:00.857
Court is adjourned.

1300
01:12:01.298 --> 01:12:02.890
Long live..
- Kanji!

1301
01:12:03.164 --> 01:12:04.756
Long live..
- Kanji!

1302
01:12:04.830 --> 01:12:06.525
Long live..
- Kanji!

1303
01:12:06.597 --> 01:12:08.155
Long live..
- Kanji!

1304
01:12:08.196 --> 01:12:09.663
Long live..
- Kanji!

1305
01:12:09.730 --> 01:12:11.527
Long live..
- Kanji!

1306
01:12:11.562 --> 01:12:13.223
Long live..
- Kanji!

1307
01:12:13.297 --> 01:12:14.696
Long live..
- Kanji!

1308
01:12:14.763 --> 01:12:15.627
Long live..
- Kanji!

1309
01:12:15.696 --> 01:12:21.692
This is government property,
you're safe here.

1310
01:12:22.528 --> 01:12:30.560
But how will you escape them, in
temples, churches and mosques?

1311
01:12:49.824 --> 01:12:52.088
What are you thinking, Leeladhar?

1312
01:12:52.457 --> 01:12:55.119
This has gone beyond the limit.

1313
01:12:55.690 --> 01:13:01.322
Stop all the shams that you're
running in the name of faith.

1314
01:13:04.755 --> 01:13:06.586
Otherwise, the day isn't far when..

1315
01:13:06.655 --> 01:13:10.113
..no one will even spare
alms in the name of God.

1316
01:13:12.154 --> 01:13:13.348
Thank you.

1317
01:13:14.353 --> 01:13:17.516
You don't understand, Leeladhar..
- Thank you.

1318
01:13:40.616 --> 01:13:42.675
This is actually a serious matter.

1319
01:13:43.383 --> 01:13:45.476
People are making him a hero..

1320
01:13:45.549 --> 01:13:49.246
..and the claim amount is increasing.

1321
01:13:49.315 --> 01:13:51.681
Will you just tell us about
the problems or do something?

1322
01:13:53.148 --> 01:13:54.547
Next week,
l've a religious programme..

1323
01:13:54.614 --> 01:13:56.411
..on the Star Cruise, in Singapore

1324
01:13:57.047 --> 01:13:59.311
And the judge says
l cannot leave the country.

1325
01:13:59.381 --> 01:14:01.315
Do something.
- l would.

1326
01:14:01.380 --> 01:14:03.473
But it's the court,
not the parliament..

1327
01:14:03.546 --> 01:14:06.447
..where we can break a few
chairs and the job's done.

1328
01:14:06.746 --> 01:14:08.270
lt's the court.

1329
01:14:08.579 --> 01:14:10.012
Let me think.

1330
01:14:10.479 --> 01:14:12.140
Well, there's one way.

1331
01:14:12.212 --> 01:14:13.338
l know it's an old idea..

1332
01:14:13.412 --> 01:14:15.437
..but these days
it's a lot in fashion.

1333
01:14:16.478 --> 01:14:18.173
Laxman Mishra guarantees..

1334
01:14:18.244 --> 01:14:20.007
..that you'll get
the sympathy of people.

1335
01:14:20.044 --> 01:14:21.375
l guarantee it.

1336
01:14:21.677 --> 01:14:23.042
Thank you.

1337
01:14:23.410 --> 01:14:26.538
Lord blessed us with everything.

1338
01:14:27.277 --> 01:14:31.111
The earth, the air, water,
the flora, fauna, everything.

1339
01:14:32.442 --> 01:14:37.004
Did He ever ask us for service tax?
- No?

1340
01:14:37.241 --> 01:14:39.607
Did he ever ask us for sales tax?
- No.

1341
01:14:40.241 --> 01:14:47.545
And today, a madman has
dragged Him to court..

1342
01:14:47.573 --> 01:14:50.599
..so, will we stay quiet?
- No.

1343
01:14:51.473 --> 01:14:52.599
We will fight.

1344
01:14:53.439 --> 01:14:54.963
We will fight together.

1345
01:14:55.605 --> 01:15:01.202
And so, guiding us on
this path, our beloved..

1346
01:15:02.105 --> 01:15:10.137
..and revered Sri Siddeshwar
Maharaj will fast unto death.

1347
01:15:10.936 --> 01:15:12.961
He will go on a hunger strike.

1348
01:15:14.435 --> 01:15:17.063
Glory to..
- Siddeshwar Maharaj

1349
01:15:17.135 --> 01:15:21.128
Today's the third day of
Siddeshwar Maharaj's hunger strike.

1350
01:15:21.635 --> 01:15:23.603
Many religious
organizations and devotees..

1351
01:15:23.635 --> 01:15:28.004
..from different parts of the
country have supported this movement.

1352
01:15:28.367 --> 01:15:30.528
On the other hand, Kanji Lalji Mehta..

1353
01:15:30.600 --> 01:15:33.194
..has refused to talk to the media.

1354
01:15:33.467 --> 01:15:35.162
He won't take a sip of water.

1355
01:15:35.233 --> 01:15:36.461
He won't stop.

1356
01:15:37.065 --> 01:15:38.396
He's an ascetic.

1357
01:15:38.599 --> 01:15:47.997
Repeat after me, Glory
to Ram, glory to Sita-Ram!

1358
01:15:59.229 --> 01:16:02.630
Hare Krishna! Hare Krishna!

1359
01:16:02.896 --> 01:16:05.194
Hare Krishna! Hare Krishna!

1360
01:16:05.262 --> 01:16:07.560
And what does God say?

1361
01:16:07.961 --> 01:16:10.555
Awaken the power of your devotion.

1362
01:16:10.928 --> 01:16:15.058
And go tell Kanji, you
can do anything you want.

1363
01:16:15.261 --> 01:16:19.595
We will continue..

1364
01:16:20.093 --> 01:16:22.926
They're defaming me
taking Krishna's name.

1365
01:16:23.425 --> 01:16:24.983
Mine too.

1366
01:16:25.058 --> 01:16:26.389
What have you got to do with this?

1367
01:16:26.492 --> 01:16:27.891
l do.

1368
01:16:27.925 --> 01:16:30.894
When they're defaming you,
they're defaming me too.

1369
01:16:30.958 --> 01:16:32.152
You're my friend after all.

1370
01:16:33.024 --> 01:16:35.959
Look, Kanji bhai, it's
the era of publicity.

1371
01:16:36.124 --> 01:16:39.821
These imposters like to show off.

1372
01:16:40.123 --> 01:16:42.353
l am fighting for my right,
that's all.

1373
01:16:42.990 --> 01:16:46.426
And you will win this fight
only when you expose their lies..

1374
01:16:46.489 --> 01:16:50.448
..and that's possible only
when you speak to the people.

1375
01:16:51.355 --> 01:16:55.416
Even Krishna had to
enter the ring to kill Kans.

1376
01:16:55.988 --> 01:16:58.456
Enough of your fairytales.

1377
01:16:59.820 --> 01:17:01.981
But l did understand one thing.

1378
01:17:03.153 --> 01:17:08.489
Now watch...
how l expose them and their God.

1379
01:17:10.986 --> 01:17:13.113
He's not going to spare me.

1380
01:17:16.851 --> 01:17:19.786
Hello, and welcome to a
very special episode..

1381
01:17:19.850 --> 01:17:21.283
..of Oh My God!

1382
01:17:21.484 --> 01:17:23.247
Why is this episode special?

1383
01:17:23.416 --> 01:17:26.044
Because Kanji Lalji Mehta..

1384
01:17:26.116 --> 01:17:30.985
..is finally here to
answer all your questions.

1385
01:17:32.782 --> 01:17:35.910
Many of you think
he's crazy and cynical.

1386
01:17:36.815 --> 01:17:40.216
He's the person
who...filed the case against God.

1387
01:17:41.281 --> 01:17:42.873
Kanji bhai, welcome to our show.

1388
01:17:42.947 --> 01:17:44.812
My first question is..

1389
01:17:45.146 --> 01:17:47.137
Why are you after all
the religious sects?

1390
01:17:48.247 --> 01:17:50.044
You media personnel, l tell you..

1391
01:17:51.379 --> 01:17:54.314
Your questions sound
more like allegations..

1392
01:17:54.379 --> 01:17:56.711
..and make us sound guilty.

1393
01:17:57.778 --> 01:18:00.872
l respect all religion
and don't believe in any.

1394
01:18:00.944 --> 01:18:02.411
This man will never change.

1395
01:18:02.711 --> 01:18:05.145
And if God exists, he will
answer all my questions.

1396
01:18:05.377 --> 01:18:07.971
Not just that, he will
support me in my fight.

1397
01:18:08.843 --> 01:18:10.037
How?

1398
01:18:13.042 --> 01:18:15.306
When you were small, a small child.

1399
01:18:15.842 --> 01:18:19.005
What would you do to ask
your papa for chocolate?

1400
01:18:20.709 --> 01:18:22.870
l mean, would you chant his name.

1401
01:18:22.941 --> 01:18:24.806
''Papa, give me chocolates.''

1402
01:18:25.140 --> 01:18:27.199
Or, did you venerate
him with incense sticks..

1403
01:18:27.274 --> 01:18:29.299
..or throw flowers...
- No, l didn't do any of that.

1404
01:18:29.807 --> 01:18:32.708
l would directly ask him
whatever l wanted. - Exactly.

1405
01:18:32.773 --> 01:18:34.263
Exactly. l'm doing the same thing.

1406
01:18:34.839 --> 01:18:39.674
People have always told me,
that God is like a father-figure.

1407
01:18:39.739 --> 01:18:43.937
Maybe? But how can l believe,
as long as l don't see Him.

1408
01:18:44.038 --> 01:18:47.303
You're an atheist, how
can God appear before you?

1409
01:18:49.637 --> 01:18:50.831
Eat. Eat.

1410
01:18:52.004 --> 01:18:56.100
Kanji bhai, even l believe that
God's like a father-figure. - Yes.

1411
01:18:56.270 --> 01:18:58.067
So, will he appear before me?

1412
01:18:58.202 --> 01:19:00.193
Do you believe in temples,
idols etcetera?

1413
01:19:00.636 --> 01:19:03.298
Yes, l do.
- Then He won't.

1414
01:19:03.369 --> 01:19:04.666
But why?

1415
01:19:04.735 --> 01:19:06.726
Because you're searching
for Him in temples and idols.

1416
01:19:06.901 --> 01:19:08.664
Then why does
He have to come personally?

1417
01:19:08.734 --> 01:19:10.326
No, this is wrong.

1418
01:19:10.834 --> 01:19:12.096
God does exist.

1419
01:19:12.167 --> 01:19:14.032
l couldn't find a
decent job for two years.

1420
01:19:14.100 --> 01:19:17.866
l prayed that if l find a job,
l will shave my head.

1421
01:19:17.933 --> 01:19:19.764
And see, l found a job.

1422
01:19:19.800 --> 01:19:21.859
Oh, you shaved off the entire thing.

1423
01:19:23.233 --> 01:19:24.723
Just imagine.

1424
01:19:24.899 --> 01:19:28.960
You're all dressed and
leaving for work in the morning..

1425
01:19:29.131 --> 01:19:31.190
..and as soon as you open your door..

1426
01:19:31.264 --> 01:19:32.856
..you see a pile of hair.

1427
01:19:34.164 --> 01:19:37.258
Black hair, white hair,
some with dandruff.

1428
01:19:37.697 --> 01:19:38.925
Some have lice.

1429
01:19:39.864 --> 01:19:42.025
There's a pile of every kind of hair.

1430
01:19:42.662 --> 01:19:44.186
Tell me how you will feel.

1431
01:19:44.263 --> 01:19:45.855
l won't like it at all.

1432
01:19:46.095 --> 01:19:48.962
lsn't it? So,
imagine how bad God feels.

1433
01:19:49.828 --> 01:19:52.126
God opens his door, and
there's hair scattered around.

1434
01:19:52.361 --> 01:19:55.091
Kanji bhai always has the right logic.

1435
01:19:55.161 --> 01:19:56.856
Do you know what's
done with all these hairs?

1436
01:19:57.861 --> 01:20:00.659
They are sold.

1437
01:20:00.993 --> 01:20:04.326
These hairs are sold in America,
London, etcetera...

1438
01:20:04.659 --> 01:20:08.288
ln short, your faith is sold.

1439
01:20:08.693 --> 01:20:10.092
That's it.

1440
01:20:11.358 --> 01:20:12.382
He is right.

1441
01:20:13.124 --> 01:20:14.318
He's got a point.

1442
01:20:14.858 --> 01:20:17.725
But that money is used to
run schools, orphanages..

1443
01:20:17.791 --> 01:20:19.782
..hospitals, charitable trusts.

1444
01:20:19.858 --> 01:20:21.052
Do you have a problem with that too?

1445
01:20:21.657 --> 01:20:24.820
lt's just like a tobacco
seller builds a cancer hospital.

1446
01:20:27.156 --> 01:20:28.919
They have to do these things, madam.

1447
01:20:29.289 --> 01:20:31.154
Because all this is unaccounted money.

1448
01:20:31.622 --> 01:20:33.920
lf you don't show
any legal transaction..

1449
01:20:33.955 --> 01:20:36.321
..then the lncome Tax people
will put you behind bars.

1450
01:20:37.021 --> 01:20:39.854
l've a problem with their
way of extracting the money.

1451
01:20:40.154 --> 01:20:42.816
Just like the mafia
scares us with a gun..

1452
01:20:42.887 --> 01:20:44.582
..these people scare us
in the name of the Lord.

1453
01:20:44.620 --> 01:20:45.587
That's a good one.

1454
01:20:45.620 --> 01:20:47.281
''Your child's stars are unfavourable.''

1455
01:20:47.787 --> 01:20:48.719
''He's unlucky.''

1456
01:20:48.786 --> 01:20:50.651
''There's an inauspicious
issue in his horoscope.''

1457
01:20:50.719 --> 01:20:52.778
''Saturn's influencing his stars...''

1458
01:20:52.853 --> 01:20:53.945
What is this?

1459
01:20:54.918 --> 01:20:57.819
He is just born, let him breathe.

1460
01:20:58.585 --> 01:21:02.214
And this is where all
their religious hoaxes begin.

1461
01:21:02.685 --> 01:21:04.983
Not just this lifetime,
but they also scare you..

1462
01:21:05.051 --> 01:21:07.144
..in the name of your next life. Yes.

1463
01:21:07.217 --> 01:21:09.208
lf you don't do this and this..

1464
01:21:09.283 --> 01:21:11.274
..then you'll become a
dog in your next lifetime.

1465
01:21:12.649 --> 01:21:14.879
Or, if you do this,
you'll be born as a insect..

1466
01:21:14.949 --> 01:21:15.938
..and go to hell.

1467
01:21:16.015 --> 01:21:18.950
And then, they read out
an entire itinerary of hell.

1468
01:21:19.882 --> 01:21:21.975
You'll be made to sleep on
a bed of nails.

1469
01:21:22.081 --> 01:21:23.742
Thrown in the sea of fire.

1470
01:21:23.814 --> 01:21:25.748
Fried in hot oil.

1471
01:21:26.747 --> 01:21:28.237
Am l a man or a fritter?

1472
01:21:31.113 --> 01:21:33.980
Wonderful, Kanji.

1473
01:21:36.979 --> 01:21:38.173
Too good.

1474
01:21:40.178 --> 01:21:42.544
So, what's the definition of
religion according to you?

1475
01:21:42.878 --> 01:21:45.176
l believe, where there's religion..

1476
01:21:45.477 --> 01:21:47.001
..there's no place for honesty.

1477
01:21:47.644 --> 01:21:51.045
And where there's truth,
you don't need religion.

1478
01:21:51.144 --> 01:21:52.543
He's absolutely right.

1479
01:21:53.010 --> 01:21:54.500
What's the role..

1480
01:21:54.610 --> 01:21:56.601
..of caste and
religion in a person's life?

1481
01:22:07.608 --> 01:22:09.667
They do just one thing, madam.

1482
01:22:09.974 --> 01:22:12.204
Either it makes them helpless.

1483
01:22:12.507 --> 01:22:13.906
..or a terrorist.

1484
01:22:20.639 --> 01:22:21.697
He's too good.

1485
01:22:21.773 --> 01:22:23.035
He'll never change.
- Sister.

1486
01:22:23.105 --> 01:22:24.732
Oh my God.

1487
01:22:24.872 --> 01:22:27.033
Oh my God, Kanji bhai.

1488
01:22:27.772 --> 01:22:30.798
Really, you've changed
my concept about God.

1489
01:22:30.904 --> 01:22:31.893
Honestly.

1490
01:22:31.938 --> 01:22:33.769
No matter what the
verdict of the court is..

1491
01:22:34.104 --> 01:22:36.163
..the young generation today,
not just the young..

1492
01:22:36.470 --> 01:22:38.802
..but every generation
needs to think like you.

1493
01:22:38.870 --> 01:22:39.859
l applaud you.

1494
01:22:39.937 --> 01:22:42.633
Hey, guys. He's my father.

1495
01:22:56.000 --> 01:22:57.433
Just a minute, priest.

1496
01:22:57.834 --> 01:23:01.531
Explain us the
meaning of these chants.

1497
01:23:01.999 --> 01:23:03.933
Priest, your fees is
500 rupees, right.

1498
01:23:03.999 --> 01:23:05.023
We will pay you that.

1499
01:23:05.066 --> 01:23:08.968
We'll pay you 5 rupees for
every mantra you explain.

1500
01:23:09.032 --> 01:23:09.930
Let's go.

1501
01:23:09.965 --> 01:23:11.660
They've seen Kanji
bhai's interview as well.

1502
01:23:11.765 --> 01:23:13.790
Let's go from here, come on.
- Priest.

1503
01:23:15.398 --> 01:23:17.958
Someone placed a big stone
in the middle of the ground.

1504
01:23:18.031 --> 01:23:19.498
And a few people anointed that stone..

1505
01:23:19.564 --> 01:23:20.553
..and adorned it with garlands.

1506
01:23:20.630 --> 01:23:22.461
Now, people call this
the temple of Hanuman..

1507
01:23:22.530 --> 01:23:24.054
..they tie bells here and pray.

1508
01:23:24.130 --> 01:23:25.791
This is the only ground.

1509
01:23:25.863 --> 01:23:26.955
Where else can we play?

1510
01:23:27.030 --> 01:23:28.019
lf the BMC doesn't do anything..

1511
01:23:28.095 --> 01:23:30.563
..then we will talk to Kanji bhai..
- Yes, yes..

1512
01:23:30.629 --> 01:23:34.759
No, no. That man spares no one.

1513
01:23:34.829 --> 01:23:36.091
l will move this temple.

1514
01:23:39.727 --> 01:23:42.890
''Hail Krishna.''

1515
01:23:42.960 --> 01:23:45.793
''Hail Krishna.''

1516
01:23:45.860 --> 01:23:49.523
''Hail Krishna.''

1517
01:23:49.660 --> 01:23:52.527
''Hail Krishna.''

1518
01:23:52.592 --> 01:23:56.050
''Hail Krishna.''

1519
01:23:56.325 --> 01:23:58.953
''Hail Krishna.''
- Miracle.

1520
01:23:59.591 --> 01:24:01.718
Swami.
- Yes.

1521
01:24:02.491 --> 01:24:04.322
Relieve me from this hunger-strike.

1522
01:24:04.591 --> 01:24:06.889
Each time l've to go to
the toilet for eating the fritter.

1523
01:24:06.957 --> 01:24:08.788
Manage a few more days..

1524
01:24:08.890 --> 01:24:12.326
..otherwise you'll have to
starve for the rest of your life.

1525
01:24:12.656 --> 01:24:15.716
You've rented such a big ground.

1526
01:24:15.789 --> 01:24:17.347
But now nobody comes here.

1527
01:24:17.855 --> 01:24:19.686
The few that are here..

1528
01:24:19.755 --> 01:24:21.052
..are the ones who
rented this dais to us.

1529
01:24:21.521 --> 01:24:24.922
l fear that if people
start believing in Kanji..

1530
01:24:24.987 --> 01:24:26.784
..then they will
lose their faith in us.

1531
01:24:27.787 --> 01:24:30.449
What if they stop
coming to the temple?

1532
01:24:30.587 --> 01:24:32.418
That won't happen.

1533
01:24:33.486 --> 01:24:36.046
ln this country,
people visit the temple..

1534
01:24:36.319 --> 01:24:37.980
..more than they visit the school.

1535
01:24:41.952 --> 01:24:45.285
The High Court has
accepted 455 cases..

1536
01:24:45.351 --> 01:24:47.785
..but we'll have to wait and watch..

1537
01:24:47.851 --> 01:24:49.910
..Kanji Lalji Mehta's
argument in the court.

1538
01:24:52.317 --> 01:24:53.545
Siddeshwar Maharaj.

1539
01:24:54.483 --> 01:24:57.975
What's the area of your temple?

1540
01:24:59.449 --> 01:25:00.916
22 acres.

1541
01:25:02.649 --> 01:25:05.277
lt has 322 small temples of God.

1542
01:25:06.248 --> 01:25:09.513
Meaning, there's an entire
shopping mall of Gods inside.

1543
01:25:13.713 --> 01:25:14.839
Silence.

1544
01:25:14.980 --> 01:25:20.350
There are 142 priests to serve
the Lord in all these temples.

1545
01:25:20.413 --> 01:25:24.577
Do you know how many
beggars are outside your temple?

1546
01:25:24.646 --> 01:25:26.546
What?
- Beggars.

1547
01:25:26.778 --> 01:25:30.874
You remember the 320
idols and 142 priests..

1548
01:25:31.444 --> 01:25:36.381
..but you do you know how many
beggars sit outside your temple?

1549
01:25:36.610 --> 01:25:39.704
Your Honour, the beggars
outside their temple..

1550
01:25:39.776 --> 01:25:41.641
..are restricted
from coming inside. No!

1551
01:25:42.177 --> 01:25:43.838
Whether its scorching heat, or rains,
just keep rotting outside.

1552
01:25:43.910 --> 01:25:45.275
Don't set foot inside.

1553
01:25:45.409 --> 01:25:47.343
Don't say no.

1554
01:25:47.408 --> 01:25:49.399
A priest from your temple told me so.

1555
01:25:49.875 --> 01:25:52.173
And he also said to me..

1556
01:25:52.674 --> 01:25:56.804
''..Kanji bhai, if you
want to win this case..''

1557
01:25:56.874 --> 01:25:58.569
''..then come here every Monday.''

1558
01:25:58.873 --> 01:26:00.864
So l asked ''Where should l come''.

1559
01:26:01.174 --> 01:26:03.233
He said, ''Come to
Lord Shiva's temple''.

1560
01:26:03.306 --> 01:26:05.740
''Offer a bowl of milk and then watch''.

1561
01:26:06.206 --> 01:26:08.538
l thought, fine, let's try it.

1562
01:26:08.772 --> 01:26:10.569
Your Honour, l went
there on a Monday..

1563
01:26:10.639 --> 01:26:13.904
..with a bowl of milk,
standing in the long queue.

1564
01:26:14.238 --> 01:26:16.706
Everyone was holding
bowl in their hands.

1565
01:26:17.371 --> 01:26:19.601
l thought there must be
someone inside to drink the milk.

1566
01:26:19.670 --> 01:26:23.231
All of them aren't fools to
stand in the line holding a jug.

1567
01:26:23.470 --> 01:26:24.368
lt was my turn, Your Honour.

1568
01:26:24.436 --> 01:26:26.529
l went inside, but
there was no in there.

1569
01:26:26.602 --> 01:26:28.365
No one to drink the milk?

1570
01:26:29.235 --> 01:26:31.669
Just then l noticed black stone.

1571
01:26:31.736 --> 01:26:34.170
lt's called 'Shiva's phallus,
you fool.

1572
01:26:34.235 --> 01:26:36.362
Yes, there was a 'Shiva's phallus.

1573
01:26:36.434 --> 01:26:37.731
And that stone.

1574
01:26:37.802 --> 01:26:39.599
That stone was
completely immersed in milk.

1575
01:26:40.134 --> 01:26:44.798
And right besides the phallus,
through a small drain..

1576
01:26:45.100 --> 01:26:47.330
..the milk was going outside.

1577
01:26:47.400 --> 01:26:50.631
l thought ''Yes, there must be
someone outside to drink the milk''.

1578
01:26:51.166 --> 01:26:52.565
But when l saw there was
no one outside as well.

1579
01:26:53.166 --> 01:26:59.264
All the milk was
going into the sewers.

1580
01:26:59.331 --> 01:27:00.320
The sewers.

1581
01:27:00.431 --> 01:27:01.693
Total waste.

1582
01:27:02.631 --> 01:27:05.498
And there was a beggar
standing right besides the sewer.

1583
01:27:05.664 --> 01:27:07.655
He must've been hungry
for the past 4-5 days.

1584
01:27:08.297 --> 01:27:09.787
He was shivering.

1585
01:27:10.530 --> 01:27:12.259
Maybe he wanted to drink the milk..

1586
01:27:12.329 --> 01:27:13.762
..but he couldn't do
so from the sewers.

1587
01:27:14.263 --> 01:27:16.527
l gave that beggar my bowl of milk.

1588
01:27:17.695 --> 01:27:20.562
And do you know what he
said after he drank the milk?

1589
01:27:21.528 --> 01:27:23.325
God bless you!

1590
01:27:30.226 --> 01:27:32.319
lf every person visiting the temple..

1591
01:27:32.393 --> 01:27:34.418
..gives the milk to a needy instead..

1592
01:27:34.493 --> 01:27:37.587
..then they will earn more merits.

1593
01:27:37.726 --> 01:27:39.091
Right?

1594
01:27:43.058 --> 01:27:47.654
lf you donate
blankets to a poor beggar..

1595
01:27:47.724 --> 01:27:52.718
..instead of offering it to shrine,
it will make Allah happy.

1596
01:27:56.123 --> 01:27:59.320
And if you light a candle
in some poor man's hut..

1597
01:27:59.422 --> 01:28:03.381
..instead of the church, they he'll never
have to live in the darkness.

1598
01:28:06.488 --> 01:28:09.719
Don't you believe in God?
- l am God.

1599
01:28:10.387 --> 01:28:12.218
And l am Amitabh Bachchan!

1600
01:28:14.620 --> 01:28:16.087
Look, Kanji.

1601
01:28:17.286 --> 01:28:20.722
Offering milk, candles,
blanket is a tradition.

1602
01:28:21.353 --> 01:28:23.321
Worshipping the Lord.

1603
01:28:25.585 --> 01:28:28.019
But you won't understand their value..

1604
01:28:28.051 --> 01:28:29.416
..because you are an atheist.

1605
01:28:30.317 --> 01:28:33.184
You're still bounded by
the illusions of this world.

1606
01:28:33.251 --> 01:28:34.548
But you aren't.

1607
01:28:34.617 --> 01:28:37.017
You're at the threshold of salvation.

1608
01:28:37.084 --> 01:28:40.485
So, why not stop the shams under
the pretext of rituals and traditions?

1609
01:28:41.517 --> 01:28:43.644
Do you know how much oil
is wasted on Saturday..

1610
01:28:43.949 --> 01:28:45.382
..on Lord Shani's idol?

1611
01:28:46.415 --> 01:28:50.681
People stick coins
on the idol like this.

1612
01:28:51.348 --> 01:28:53.339
What will Hanuman do
with all that change?

1613
01:28:53.414 --> 01:28:55.473
Kanji is absolutely right.

1614
01:28:56.380 --> 01:29:00.146
Sai Baba lived in poverty
all his life, for the poor.

1615
01:29:00.580 --> 01:29:02.411
As long as he was alive..

1616
01:29:02.479 --> 01:29:05.676
..he wandered around
for a drop of oil.

1617
01:29:06.146 --> 01:29:07.613
And today, after he's dead.

1618
01:29:08.346 --> 01:29:10.007
Throne worth millions.

1619
01:29:11.045 --> 01:29:15.175
Gold crown. What for?

1620
01:29:16.978 --> 01:29:19.412
Tell me one thing.

1621
01:29:20.077 --> 01:29:24.446
Anyone who is a
faithful devotee of the Lord..

1622
01:29:24.476 --> 01:29:28.003
..is blessed with His grace.

1623
01:29:28.143 --> 01:29:29.371
Right?

1624
01:29:30.375 --> 01:29:33.640
Right?
- Yes.

1625
01:29:33.941 --> 01:29:36.967
So tell me, why does a bus heading..

1626
01:29:37.142 --> 01:29:42.102
..for a trip to Amarnath or
Vaishno Devi falls in the ravine?

1627
01:29:43.074 --> 01:29:44.939
They were going to serve the Lord.

1628
01:29:45.340 --> 01:29:46.500
They were going with complete faith..

1629
01:29:46.573 --> 01:29:48.063
..and singing religious discourses.

1630
01:29:48.206 --> 01:29:49.969
So, the Lord called them directly.

1631
01:29:50.372 --> 01:29:52.966
And show me one car
which met with an accident..

1632
01:29:53.038 --> 01:29:56.633
..and doesn't have God's
idol or photo kept inside.

1633
01:29:57.671 --> 01:29:59.366
Speek up.
- l object, Your Honour.

1634
01:30:00.605 --> 01:30:04.006
From day 1 this man's
trying to twist the case around.

1635
01:30:04.504 --> 01:30:06.563
Mr. Kanji, this isn't
a debate about good and bad.

1636
01:30:06.936 --> 01:30:08.665
This is the court,
we only believe on proofs here.

1637
01:30:09.170 --> 01:30:12.298
And we have proof, your
signatures on the insurance papers.

1638
01:30:13.169 --> 01:30:14.500
And legally you have no right
to ask for any compensation..

1639
01:30:14.569 --> 01:30:15.558
..from the insurance company.

1640
01:30:15.635 --> 01:30:17.364
And as far as we're concerned.

1641
01:30:19.201 --> 01:30:22.034
We don't believe in the
insurance company's conditions.

1642
01:30:23.968 --> 01:30:27.927
lf they say that the
judge caused the earthquake..

1643
01:30:27.967 --> 01:30:29.457
..will the judge have
to pay you compensation?

1644
01:30:29.933 --> 01:30:32.629
Similarly, if God's name
is written on the policy..

1645
01:30:32.933 --> 01:30:35.458
..he isn't liable to
pay the compensation.

1646
01:30:37.465 --> 01:30:39.524
lf you want
God to give you compensation.

1647
01:30:40.265 --> 01:30:42.859
Then prove that
God caused this earthquake.

1648
01:30:42.898 --> 01:30:44.957
He did..
- But, in writing.

1649
01:30:47.231 --> 01:30:49.358
Do you have it...in writing?

1650
01:30:49.864 --> 01:30:51.923
Do you have it? Any proof?

1651
01:30:54.597 --> 01:30:58.294
Your Honour..
- Mr. Kanji, the court of law..

1652
01:30:58.362 --> 01:31:00.421
..cannot give a verdict
on just arguments alone.

1653
01:31:01.395 --> 01:31:06.196
Your arguments maybe
valid for the common people..

1654
01:31:06.528 --> 01:31:11.124
..but if you cannot
prove them, it has no value.

1655
01:31:12.128 --> 01:31:13.459
Do you have any proof?

1656
01:31:17.227 --> 01:31:20.594
No. - ln that case,
the court gives you a month's time..

1657
01:31:20.959 --> 01:31:23.257
..which is your last chance.

1658
01:31:23.925 --> 01:31:26.951
On the next hearing,
if you cannot produce any evidence..

1659
01:31:27.024 --> 01:31:32.121
..then l'm afraid you will have
to rest your case and all others.

1660
01:31:34.224 --> 01:31:35.851
Court is adjurned for the day.

1661
01:31:38.923 --> 01:31:40.117
Relax.

1662
01:31:40.823 --> 01:31:42.814
Next time l see you
in this courtroom..

1663
01:31:42.856 --> 01:31:45.222
..l will sue you for defamation,
and you'll lose..

1664
01:31:45.288 --> 01:31:46.949
..whatever you have left.

1665
01:31:48.355 --> 01:31:49.822
Relax.

1666
01:32:06.819 --> 01:32:08.980
What will you do now? How will
you prove it in the court now?

1667
01:32:09.285 --> 01:32:10.877
Because you're not alone, Mr. Kanji.

1668
01:32:10.952 --> 01:32:12.317
lt's a matter of crores of rupees.

1669
01:32:12.384 --> 01:32:14.318
Many people have hopes with you.

1670
01:32:14.384 --> 01:32:17.319
Sir, how will you get a proof in writing?
- Sir, what about these people now?

1671
01:32:32.082 --> 01:32:33.879
You aren't playing your flute today.

1672
01:32:34.515 --> 01:32:36.745
You don't like it,
so l'm sitting quietly.

1673
01:32:37.315 --> 01:32:40.773
l like it. You play it well too.

1674
01:32:41.247 --> 01:32:42.737
Thank you.

1675
01:32:43.180 --> 01:32:45.410
You look worried.
- Yes.

1676
01:32:45.713 --> 01:32:49.149
The court says get us proof,
and in writing.

1677
01:32:49.413 --> 01:32:50.903
How do l get proof?

1678
01:32:50.979 --> 01:32:53.743
There's a consultant sitting
right next to you, ask me.

1679
01:32:55.212 --> 01:32:57.442
This isn't some housing loan issue.

1680
01:32:58.711 --> 01:32:59.871
lt's a court case.

1681
01:33:00.311 --> 01:33:01.243
lt's a big problem.

1682
01:33:01.311 --> 01:33:02.778
l've a suggestion.

1683
01:33:04.744 --> 01:33:06.006
Give me the alcohol.

1684
01:33:07.276 --> 01:33:08.766
You drink this milk.

1685
01:33:09.110 --> 01:33:09.974
You want me to mix them.

1686
01:33:10.043 --> 01:33:12.102
No, no, just drink the milk.

1687
01:33:12.743 --> 01:33:14.108
And l will give you the solution.

1688
01:33:16.742 --> 01:33:19.438
You know, Kanji,
where's the solution..

1689
01:33:19.708 --> 01:33:22.768
..to all the problems,
tensions and trouble written?

1690
01:33:23.074 --> 01:33:25.167
Where?
- ln this book.

1691
01:33:27.240 --> 01:33:28.764
'Shrimad Bhagvad Gita.'

1692
01:33:28.841 --> 01:33:30.809
Have your read it?
- Who can possibly read it?

1693
01:33:30.873 --> 01:33:32.033
lt's such a thick book.

1694
01:33:32.107 --> 01:33:33.267
And not a single photograph.

1695
01:33:33.773 --> 01:33:35.707
How can anyone read it,
it's not interesting at all.

1696
01:33:37.672 --> 01:33:38.798
l used to keep it in my shop.

1697
01:33:39.005 --> 01:33:40.097
But it would fetch a small margin.

1698
01:33:40.371 --> 01:33:42.635
Plus it catches termites.

1699
01:33:42.672 --> 01:33:44.731
lt causes problems. So l threw it out.

1700
01:33:44.804 --> 01:33:45.964
Threw it?
- Yes, l threw it.

1701
01:33:46.038 --> 01:33:47.869
You threw the Bhagwad Gita out.
- Yes.

1702
01:33:47.904 --> 01:33:49.371
Wow!
- Why?

1703
01:33:50.903 --> 01:33:53.963
Kanji, the Gita,
Bible, Koran has answers..

1704
01:33:54.037 --> 01:33:55.937
..to every problems of humans.

1705
01:33:56.703 --> 01:33:58.728
l know you don't believe in all this.

1706
01:33:59.368 --> 01:34:03.168
But for your own good,
read this book once.

1707
01:34:05.001 --> 01:34:06.263
And see the result.

1708
01:34:06.367 --> 01:34:08.130
And if the result isn't good..

1709
01:34:08.868 --> 01:34:10.267
..then you can throw it out.

1710
01:34:12.234 --> 01:34:15.169
Kanji bhai read it once, and then see.

1711
01:34:16.799 --> 01:34:18.323
Okay.

1712
01:34:30.264 --> 01:34:34.894
''l am not human.''

1713
01:34:35.297 --> 01:34:38.926
''l am sold in stores.''

1714
01:34:40.130 --> 01:34:44.760
''l created the world.''

1715
01:34:45.062 --> 01:34:49.226
''Not with mud, but with my emotions.''

1716
01:34:49.961 --> 01:34:52.293
''l am wandering around..''

1717
01:34:52.594 --> 01:34:58.260
''..looking for my signs,
where are they.''

1718
01:34:58.593 --> 01:35:02.996
''Where are my signs?''

1719
01:35:03.026 --> 01:35:05.551
Stop begging in the name of Allah.

1720
01:35:05.826 --> 01:35:08.158
Stop begging and do some hard work.

1721
01:35:10.592 --> 01:35:12.583
''My signs.''

1722
01:35:12.925 --> 01:35:15.587
''My signs.''

1723
01:35:51.152 --> 01:35:55.680
''l was always with
you as your shadow.''

1724
01:35:56.019 --> 01:36:00.979
''l gave you shade when
the heat was strong.''

1725
01:36:01.051 --> 01:36:09.516
''l was your
companion in your journey.''

1726
01:36:10.783 --> 01:36:15.220
''Still you're confused.''

1727
01:36:15.716 --> 01:36:20.050
''Looking for your
answers in the question.''

1728
01:36:20.648 --> 01:36:24.846
''Where are you lost?''

1729
01:36:26.714 --> 01:36:31.515
''Where are my signs?''

1730
01:36:31.580 --> 01:36:36.540
''Where are my signs?''

1731
01:36:36.612 --> 01:36:38.637
''My signs.''

1732
01:36:43.511 --> 01:36:45.741
''My signs.''

1733
01:36:45.844 --> 01:36:48.438
''My signs.''

1734
01:36:53.143 --> 01:36:55.611
''My signs.''

1735
01:36:55.676 --> 01:36:58.736
''My signs.''

1736
01:37:12.773 --> 01:37:14.536
Wear your slippers.
- oh.

1737
01:37:16.506 --> 01:37:17.530
Thief.

1738
01:37:17.872 --> 01:37:19.601
Those are my slippers.

1739
01:37:20.572 --> 01:37:23.132
''Where are my signs?''

1740
01:37:23.439 --> 01:37:25.407
Sir, shoe polish.
- No.

1741
01:37:25.439 --> 01:37:26.963
Sir, recognise me.
The beggar outside the shrine.

1742
01:37:27.038 --> 01:37:28.596
You told me to make an honest living.

1743
01:37:28.671 --> 01:37:30.104
Shake hands, shake hands.

1744
01:37:32.471 --> 01:37:33.961
''My signs.''

1745
01:37:34.037 --> 01:37:36.369
''My signs.''

1746
01:37:44.935 --> 01:37:47.733
Today's the last hearing on
the case filed against God.

1747
01:37:47.968 --> 01:37:49.833
The claim amount is 400 crore rupees.

1748
01:37:50.401 --> 01:37:51.993
Can Kanji bhai win this case?

1749
01:37:52.601 --> 01:37:54.034
We'll have to wait and watch.

1750
01:37:56.467 --> 01:37:57.900
You can please proceed.

1751
01:37:58.567 --> 01:38:01.559
Your Honour,
before Mr. Kanji can express..

1752
01:38:01.633 --> 01:38:03.999
..his sharp and witty
views before the court..

1753
01:38:04.366 --> 01:38:06.698
..without any reference,
l would like to ask..

1754
01:38:07.366 --> 01:38:08.663
..does he have any evidence,
to prove..

1755
01:38:08.732 --> 01:38:11.394
..that God has demolished his shop?

1756
01:38:12.365 --> 01:38:16.324
Your Honour, l require a learned man..

1757
01:38:16.364 --> 01:38:19.731
..for the next
question l'm going to ask.

1758
01:38:20.464 --> 01:38:23.490
So, whoever amongst you is
the learned one can come here.

1759
01:38:23.863 --> 01:38:25.922
The learned one, please come here.

1760
01:38:28.462 --> 01:38:30.020
Please sit down.

1761
01:38:35.394 --> 01:38:36.588
Come.

1762
01:38:48.993 --> 01:38:53.362
You sages always speak
about the scriptures..

1763
01:38:53.426 --> 01:38:55.018
..in their preaching.

1764
01:38:55.292 --> 01:38:57.920
ls everything written
in the scriptures true?

1765
01:38:58.491 --> 01:38:59.924
Absolutely.

1766
01:38:59.957 --> 01:39:01.948
lt's not written anywhere,
you're saying that.

1767
01:39:02.724 --> 01:39:04.248
lt's written in the Gita.

1768
01:39:04.323 --> 01:39:06.484
lt is. What's written in the Gita?

1769
01:39:07.390 --> 01:39:11.827
Chapter four, verse forty of Gita.

1770
01:39:25.887 --> 01:39:27.878
Meaning?
- lt means..

1771
01:39:28.320 --> 01:39:35.317
Any illiterate, or faithless
person that doubts the Gita..

1772
01:39:35.819 --> 01:39:37.753
..is destined to ruination.

1773
01:39:38.552 --> 01:39:42.579
He stays devoid of
sanctity on earth and on heaven.

1774
01:39:42.651 --> 01:39:44.243
Understood?

1775
01:39:46.484 --> 01:39:48.315
He's an interesting character.

1776
01:39:50.350 --> 01:39:56.380
Do you understand anything
written in The Gita or the Scriptures?

1777
01:39:56.749 --> 01:39:58.979
Or are you blindly agreeing..

1778
01:39:59.315 --> 01:40:01.283
..to whatever Leeladhar is saying.

1779
01:40:01.615 --> 01:40:03.879
Your Honour,
small children in school..

1780
01:40:03.948 --> 01:40:05.711
..don't remember the entire prayer.

1781
01:40:06.281 --> 01:40:08.249
So they just close their eyes and...

1782
01:40:08.281 --> 01:40:09.680
Move their lips.

1783
01:40:09.814 --> 01:40:11.611
They move their lips and
you're moving your hands.

1784
01:40:11.681 --> 01:40:13.239
Kanji.

1785
01:40:14.347 --> 01:40:18.579
You've insulted a learned sage.

1786
01:40:18.646 --> 01:40:21.342
So?
- You won't get refuge even in hell.

1787
01:40:21.712 --> 01:40:23.441
How can l?

1788
01:40:24.245 --> 01:40:26.975
You've already reserved places there.

1789
01:40:32.277 --> 01:40:34.268
How dare you?

1790
01:40:34.877 --> 01:40:36.310
How dare you?

1791
01:40:36.643 --> 01:40:38.736
Atheist!

1792
01:40:40.710 --> 01:40:42.302
Silence.
- Leave me! Leave me!

1793
01:40:42.376 --> 01:40:43.741
What are you doing?

1794
01:40:43.809 --> 01:40:46.744
This is the court, sit down.

1795
01:40:48.741 --> 01:40:51.301
Order, order.

1796
01:40:53.807 --> 01:40:55.240
Sit down everyone.

1797
01:41:14.538 --> 01:41:17.439
Chapter 2, verse 56.

1798
01:41:19.303 --> 01:41:25.401
Meaning, a person for whom
happiness and sorrows is equal..

1799
01:41:25.436 --> 01:41:30.897
..and is devoid of anger and fear,
and has a calm mind..

1800
01:41:31.202 --> 01:41:33.295
..is called a learned person.

1801
01:41:38.701 --> 01:41:40.532
They'll teach me Gita?

1802
01:41:40.801 --> 01:41:43.133
They can't teach me, Your Honour.

1803
01:41:43.200 --> 01:41:46.328
Their lQ is lower than
the room temperature.

1804
01:41:49.466 --> 01:41:53.425
l said a few things to instigate you..

1805
01:41:53.499 --> 01:41:54.796
..you tried to harm me.

1806
01:41:55.265 --> 01:41:58.132
ls this your achievement, Siddeshwar?

1807
01:41:58.198 --> 01:42:01.395
Mr. Kanji, the issue
isn't his achievement..

1808
01:42:01.464 --> 01:42:03.591
..the issue here is
who razed down your shop?

1809
01:42:04.131 --> 01:42:05.155
God did.

1810
01:42:05.230 --> 01:42:06.128
You're giving a verdict.

1811
01:42:06.196 --> 01:42:08.289
That's the judge's duty.

1812
01:42:08.729 --> 01:42:10.629
You just have to prove..

1813
01:42:10.696 --> 01:42:13.164
..that God caused that earthquake.

1814
01:42:13.229 --> 01:42:14.355
Yes, and it's
impossible to prove that.

1815
01:42:14.429 --> 01:42:15.760
Relax, relax, relax.

1816
01:42:15.828 --> 01:42:17.557
Nothing is impossible.

1817
01:42:19.261 --> 01:42:22.526
Tell me one thing.

1818
01:42:22.861 --> 01:42:26.592
The Lord has narrated
the 'Bhagvad Gita'. - Yes.

1819
01:42:26.661 --> 01:42:29.755
And everything said in
the 'Bhagvad Gita' is true.

1820
01:42:30.593 --> 01:42:31.719
Absolutely.

1821
01:42:32.127 --> 01:42:33.458
Point to be noted, Your Honour.

1822
01:42:33.693 --> 01:42:37.686
So tell me, why did God say in the
eight verse of the ninth chapter..

1823
01:42:37.759 --> 01:42:43.026
..of the 'Gita',
''l've created the entire universe..''

1824
01:42:43.291 --> 01:42:45.589
''..and it will be
destroyed on my will''.

1825
01:42:45.658 --> 01:42:48.320
''The entire creation follows my will.''

1826
01:42:48.757 --> 01:42:52.318
''lt is only l, who is responsible..

1827
01:42:52.390 --> 01:42:54.324
..for its creation
and its destruction.''

1828
01:42:55.456 --> 01:42:57.117
And look.

1829
01:42:57.189 --> 01:42:59.487
Your Honour, it's been
said in the Bible as well.

1830
01:43:00.689 --> 01:43:03.522
Chapter 54, verse 16.

1831
01:43:05.655 --> 01:43:09.113
''See, it is l who have
created the smith..''

1832
01:43:09.187 --> 01:43:12.213
''..who blows the fire of coals
and produces a weapon..''

1833
01:43:12.286 --> 01:43:13.583
''..fit for his purpose.''

1834
01:43:14.120 --> 01:43:18.113
''l've also created the
ravager to destroy.''

1835
01:43:18.686 --> 01:43:20.085
And see this.

1836
01:43:20.152 --> 01:43:21.517
Also in the Holy Quran.

1837
01:43:22.185 --> 01:43:25.746
Sur-e-Zalzala 99,
verse 108 states that..

1838
01:43:26.251 --> 01:43:30.119
''..the entire earth will
be shaken to its core.''

1839
01:43:30.284 --> 01:43:34.050
''And the earth will
spill out its burden.''

1840
01:43:34.183 --> 01:43:36.981
''And humans will question,
what's happening.''

1841
01:43:37.217 --> 01:43:40.584
''And that day,
she will unveil her plight.''

1842
01:43:40.982 --> 01:43:45.419
''Because the Lord would've
ordered her to do so.''

1843
01:43:45.548 --> 01:43:47.106
''The Lord.''

1844
01:43:54.280 --> 01:43:57.147
All these things mean the same thing..

1845
01:43:58.247 --> 01:44:00.408
..that my shop was razed down..

1846
01:44:00.446 --> 01:44:02.971
..due to the earthquake caused by God.

1847
01:44:03.046 --> 01:44:05.537
That means it is an act of God.

1848
01:44:06.146 --> 01:44:08.011
lt's His doing.

1849
01:44:08.545 --> 01:44:11.173
And, all those who
have suffered losses..

1850
01:44:11.245 --> 01:44:15.944
..due to Him, will have
to be compensated by God.

1851
01:44:19.577 --> 01:44:21.636
Otherwise, their collection agents.

1852
01:44:26.143 --> 01:44:27.974
Your Honour, Mr. Kanji is
trying to confuse Leeladhar..

1853
01:44:28.042 --> 01:44:29.100
..with his words.

1854
01:44:29.175 --> 01:44:30.335
Mr. Sardesai.

1855
01:44:31.242 --> 01:44:33.335
What are you doing? Let him speak.

1856
01:44:33.508 --> 01:44:35.533
lf it's proven that God exists..

1857
01:44:35.974 --> 01:44:37.441
..then we won't have to pay.

1858
01:44:37.475 --> 01:44:38.965
l see.

1859
01:44:39.607 --> 01:44:42.371
- Now you want to blame us completely.
- Be quiet.

1860
01:44:42.440 --> 01:44:45.432
- You cannot blame the Lord
to hide your sins. - Be quiet.

1861
01:44:45.539 --> 01:44:48.167
Because only we have
a copyright on God.

1862
01:44:48.239 --> 01:44:49.570
Copyright?

1863
01:44:49.872 --> 01:44:51.362
Just because you constructed
a few temples.. - Silence.

1864
01:44:51.439 --> 01:44:52.963
..you think God belongs to you..

1865
01:44:53.338 --> 01:44:54.600
Beware.

1866
01:44:54.905 --> 01:44:56.566
Our community won't spare you.

1867
01:44:56.871 --> 01:44:58.065
What's he..
- Silence!

1868
01:44:58.105 --> 01:44:59.367
Relax.

1869
01:45:01.038 --> 01:45:05.441
Until today l had heard
that God is venerated..

1870
01:45:05.503 --> 01:45:08.301
..He is worshipped, prayed to.

1871
01:45:08.570 --> 01:45:12.563
But now l see that
Gods have copyrights too.

1872
01:45:15.469 --> 01:45:17.164
God's copyright?

1873
01:45:17.235 --> 01:45:19.863
These people have
turned God into a brand.

1874
01:45:21.234 --> 01:45:25.432
Now l am assured
that God doesn't exist.

1875
01:45:26.201 --> 01:45:27.429
Not possible.

1876
01:45:27.567 --> 01:45:29.865
Because if He really existed..

1877
01:45:29.933 --> 01:45:33.164
..he would've rid
the world of imposters like you.

1878
01:45:34.066 --> 01:45:37.502
l've already proven what
l wanted to, Your Honour.

1879
01:45:38.265 --> 01:45:40.233
Now the verdict..

1880
01:45:46.530 --> 01:45:48.361
Mr. Kanji, are you alright?

1881
01:45:49.297 --> 01:45:52.494
Mr. kanji, are you alright?

1882
01:45:53.896 --> 01:45:54.885
Mr. Kanji.

1883
01:45:54.963 --> 01:45:56.521
Kanji bhai! Kanji bhai!

1884
01:45:56.796 --> 01:45:58.263
Kanji bhai! Kanji bhai!

1885
01:45:58.329 --> 01:46:00.388
What's wrong with my brother?

1886
01:46:00.462 --> 01:46:02.259
Someone get water.

1887
01:46:02.795 --> 01:46:04.387
Kanji bhai! Kanji bhai!

1888
01:46:05.794 --> 01:46:06.852
Thank you.
- Call the ambulance.

1889
01:46:06.928 --> 01:46:08.156
Call the ambulance.

1890
01:46:16.892 --> 01:46:18.450
Yes, he's here.

1891
01:46:18.526 --> 01:46:19.925
Excuse me.
- Just a minute, just a minute.

1892
01:46:19.993 --> 01:46:23.258
Let me thought.
- Please let us pass.

1893
01:46:23.425 --> 01:46:25.290
You cannot go inside.
- No, no, no.

1894
01:46:25.359 --> 01:46:27.793
Please, l said you cannot..
- But he's my husband.

1895
01:46:27.825 --> 01:46:29.019
l want to see him.

1896
01:46:31.824 --> 01:46:34.554
Doctor, is he alright?

1897
01:46:35.256 --> 01:46:36.883
lt's a severe attack of paralysis.

1898
01:46:37.156 --> 01:46:38.384
And now he's gone into coma.

1899
01:46:58.354 --> 01:47:00.413
He's on ventilator and..

1900
01:47:00.753 --> 01:47:02.345
..only God can save him now.

1901
01:47:15.751 --> 01:47:17.946
The 400 crore in
compensations under the 'Act of God'..

1902
01:47:18.017 --> 01:47:19.416
..will now be paid out.

1903
01:47:23.083 --> 01:47:25.381
Great, Lord.

1904
01:48:14.675 --> 01:48:16.006
Where am l?

1905
01:48:17.108 --> 01:48:18.234
Don't say that.

1906
01:48:21.308 --> 01:48:22.707
You're in the lCU.

1907
01:48:23.107 --> 01:48:24.802
Your wife and children are outside.

1908
01:48:25.840 --> 01:48:27.671
No one's allowed inside.

1909
01:48:29.306 --> 01:48:30.739
Then how did you come in?

1910
01:48:33.106 --> 01:48:34.630
l came here to wake you up.

1911
01:48:37.672 --> 01:48:39.606
lt's time for you to get up.

1912
01:48:46.071 --> 01:48:48.130
You cussed God from your heart.

1913
01:48:50.103 --> 01:48:51.661
And where's the heart?

1914
01:48:52.070 --> 01:48:53.560
On your left.

1915
01:48:54.036 --> 01:48:57.301
So God has paralysed
your entire left side.

1916
01:48:59.668 --> 01:49:02.159
l am not saying this..

1917
01:49:03.602 --> 01:49:07.163
..it's the media outside
spreading this rumour.

1918
01:49:08.268 --> 01:49:11.669
l can cure you if you want.

1919
01:49:12.733 --> 01:49:14.598
So, you're a doctor now.

1920
01:49:15.167 --> 01:49:16.691
l am all in one.

1921
01:49:17.566 --> 01:49:19.295
Want to see a miracle.

1922
01:49:21.599 --> 01:49:27.299
Soaring around on
the bike isn't called miracle.

1923
01:49:27.631 --> 01:49:28.757
l see.

1924
01:49:30.831 --> 01:49:32.230
Here we go.

1925
01:50:19.290 --> 01:50:22.919
Krishna Vasudev Yadav, from Gokul.

1926
01:50:26.855 --> 01:50:28.220
Do you believe now?

1927
01:50:36.621 --> 01:50:39.818
''You're my mother, and my father.''

1928
01:50:40.054 --> 01:50:43.512
''You're my friend, and my companion.''

1929
01:50:43.887 --> 01:50:47.015
l've donned the same
form you always see..

1930
01:50:47.086 --> 01:50:50.522
..on televisions, calendars, movies.

1931
01:50:50.786 --> 01:50:52.845
l've been seen in this form for ages.

1932
01:50:52.918 --> 01:50:54.749
And l'm standing before
you in that same form.

1933
01:50:57.551 --> 01:51:01.043
But Kanji bhai, l'm not like that.

1934
01:51:03.483 --> 01:51:04.882
You really..

1935
01:51:06.016 --> 01:51:09.008
Forgive me, forgive me.

1936
01:51:09.983 --> 01:51:12.975
Just like a devotee is
incomplete without his God..

1937
01:51:14.115 --> 01:51:19.576
..similarly, God is incomplete
without his true devotee.

1938
01:51:25.814 --> 01:51:28.214
Why didn't you show me
this miracle before?

1939
01:51:30.913 --> 01:51:32.141
That's the problem.

1940
01:51:35.146 --> 01:51:36.613
Friend.

1941
01:51:37.612 --> 01:51:39.978
l am Krishna,
that's why l perform miracles.

1942
01:51:41.478 --> 01:51:45.073
l'm not Krishna,
because l perform miracles.

1943
01:51:46.778 --> 01:51:48.507
That means you're real.

1944
01:51:48.910 --> 01:51:50.138
God exists.

1945
01:51:50.743 --> 01:51:54.645
And God isn't my father-figure,
he's my friend.

1946
01:51:54.709 --> 01:51:59.908
l am everyone's friend,
but no one understands me one.

1947
01:51:59.975 --> 01:52:01.806
People gave you a high position.

1948
01:52:02.042 --> 01:52:03.669
And you staggered.

1949
01:52:04.474 --> 01:52:07.443
Yes, but l am not
like people think of me.

1950
01:52:08.575 --> 01:52:10.065
l've common sense too.

1951
01:52:10.974 --> 01:52:15.968
l am not interested
in people's offerings.

1952
01:52:16.407 --> 01:52:19.433
l want them to
distribute all this to the poor.

1953
01:52:20.005 --> 01:52:24.806
All l care about is their faith,
their love, their belief.

1954
01:52:24.872 --> 01:52:26.464
Just a minute.

1955
01:52:26.904 --> 01:52:28.132
Belief?

1956
01:52:28.538 --> 01:52:30.403
But l never believed in You.

1957
01:52:30.804 --> 01:52:32.135
l was an atheist.

1958
01:52:32.771 --> 01:52:33.999
Why did You show yourself to only me?

1959
01:52:35.370 --> 01:52:36.496
Kanji bhai, sit down.

1960
01:52:43.835 --> 01:52:45.325
Do you know what atheist means?

1961
01:52:47.402 --> 01:52:49.962
Someone who examines, thinks,
understands..

1962
01:52:50.035 --> 01:52:51.662
..and says that this is wrong.

1963
01:52:52.035 --> 01:52:53.332
The Lord doesn't exist.

1964
01:52:53.367 --> 01:52:55.528
He's an atheist.

1965
01:52:55.767 --> 01:52:57.325
That's why l appeared before you.

1966
01:52:57.867 --> 01:53:00.768
Because you did
everything a true atheist does.

1967
01:53:00.999 --> 01:53:04.628
And a true atheist can
become a real believer.

1968
01:53:05.365 --> 01:53:07.799
People come to me for
their own self-interest.

1969
01:53:08.599 --> 01:53:10.794
They come with
different exchange offers.

1970
01:53:11.032 --> 01:53:12.465
Exchange offer?

1971
01:53:12.998 --> 01:53:14.863
''Lord, if l pass my SSC exams..''

1972
01:53:14.931 --> 01:53:16.899
''..l will walk to
Siddhivinayak for 5 Tuesdays.''

1973
01:53:18.430 --> 01:53:22.491
''lf Dominic's agrees to marry me..''

1974
01:53:22.996 --> 01:53:26.329
''..l will light 11 candles
at Mt. Mary.''

1975
01:53:26.863 --> 01:53:29.661
''lf my wife gets pregnant..''

1976
01:53:29.862 --> 01:53:32.330
''..then l will come and
offer a blanket at your shrine.''

1977
01:53:32.828 --> 01:53:34.318
Different offers.

1978
01:53:34.928 --> 01:53:38.830
And those who can't blame me for it.

1979
01:53:39.460 --> 01:53:41.360
They say, we couldn't go there..

1980
01:53:41.460 --> 01:53:42.984
..because the Lord didn't call us.

1981
01:53:43.993 --> 01:53:45.722
The Lord didn't call?

1982
01:53:45.760 --> 01:53:46.692
Do they need a invitation card..
- Yes.

1983
01:53:46.760 --> 01:53:48.625
Do you want me to write
you an invitation card?

1984
01:53:48.892 --> 01:53:50.757
Don't l have anything better to do?

1985
01:53:51.458 --> 01:53:54.325
And anyway, Kanji bhai,
l am present in every element.

1986
01:53:54.659 --> 01:53:55.819
l am omnipresent.

1987
01:53:55.891 --> 01:53:57.483
lf you're present everywhere..

1988
01:53:57.524 --> 01:53:58.991
..why have they built temples?

1989
01:53:59.257 --> 01:54:00.986
l've my own house.

1990
01:54:01.591 --> 01:54:03.684
l don't want to live
inside those four walls.

1991
01:54:03.857 --> 01:54:06.758
Then? Why did you
create such a religion?

1992
01:54:07.256 --> 01:54:09.451
l only created humans.

1993
01:54:09.523 --> 01:54:12.617
And humans started religion, caste.

1994
01:54:12.689 --> 01:54:14.748
And it's been going on for years now..

1995
01:54:14.822 --> 01:54:17.256
..because you need it.

1996
01:54:17.322 --> 01:54:19.415
But one should
discard such a religion.

1997
01:54:20.821 --> 01:54:23.415
Never snatch the
religion from the people.

1998
01:54:23.787 --> 01:54:28.622
lf you take them away, they
will make you their religion.

1999
01:54:30.686 --> 01:54:32.313
You don't believe it, do you?

2000
01:54:35.885 --> 01:54:37.853
You've been in coma for a month.

2001
01:54:39.785 --> 01:54:41.412
Let me show you what has happened..

2002
01:54:41.485 --> 01:54:43.180
..in the past one month.

2003
01:54:44.251 --> 01:54:49.780
Kanji Prabhu paid me
a visit in my dreams yesterday.

2004
01:54:49.850 --> 01:54:55.482
And he said he's
the 11th Avatar of Lord Vishnu.

2005
01:54:55.550 --> 01:54:57.211
What's going on?

2006
01:54:58.249 --> 01:55:01.650
Kanji Prabhu appeared
in his four-armed form.

2007
01:55:02.515 --> 01:55:05.848
Holding the mace, the conch..

2008
01:55:07.314 --> 01:55:09.179
People all around the world..

2009
01:55:09.214 --> 01:55:10.909
..are seeing signs
of Kanji's Godly form.

2010
01:55:11.180 --> 01:55:12.647
l was on night duty.

2011
01:55:12.713 --> 01:55:14.442
A just closed my eyes.

2012
01:55:14.513 --> 01:55:16.879
And someone slapped me.

2013
01:55:17.179 --> 01:55:20.444
And that's when l heard a voice,
''No sleeping on duty''.

2014
01:55:20.512 --> 01:55:23.606
Circulate a few miraculous
stories of Kanji in the market..

2015
01:55:23.745 --> 01:55:25.508
..and people will
spread it like wildfire.

2016
01:55:26.212 --> 01:55:30.342
l had seen Kanji Prabhu
flying with his scooter.

2017
01:55:30.444 --> 01:55:32.173
He appeared suddenly.

2018
01:55:32.244 --> 01:55:34.303
10 feet, 15 feet, 20 feet.

2019
01:55:34.377 --> 01:55:35.844
Brother Kanji is God.

2020
01:55:36.110 --> 01:55:37.441
He is God.

2021
01:55:38.176 --> 01:55:40.804
The 'dharma gurus' have accepted
Kanji bhai's Kalki avatar..

2022
01:55:41.109 --> 01:55:43.100
..asked for an apology
and have decided..

2023
01:55:43.175 --> 01:55:45.666
..to pay the claims worth 400 crore.

2024
01:55:46.209 --> 01:55:50.145
lt was His will that we
should pay, so we did.

2025
01:55:50.208 --> 01:55:51.800
But why are you making him God?

2026
01:55:52.108 --> 01:55:53.507
Who told you that he is God?

2027
01:55:53.541 --> 01:55:57.534
Do you know...when you will die?

2028
01:55:58.473 --> 01:56:00.202
Do you?
- No.

2029
01:56:00.640 --> 01:56:02.437
l don't know either.

2030
01:56:03.739 --> 01:56:08.506
But he has decided his death day.

2031
01:56:10.838 --> 01:56:13.807
On 16th December as soon as
we switch off the ventilator..

2032
01:56:14.105 --> 01:56:15.470
..Kanji's story will be over.

2033
01:56:16.104 --> 01:56:18.299
But this time we've
incurred heavy losses.

2034
01:56:18.737 --> 01:56:20.568
400 crores in insurance claims.

2035
01:56:20.637 --> 01:56:21.797
One crore to the doctor.

2036
01:56:22.103 --> 01:56:23.798
And the expense to
construct the temple.

2037
01:56:24.103 --> 01:56:26.162
lt's a onetime investment, Mr. Mishra.

2038
01:56:26.270 --> 01:56:28.397
We'll recover it in a year.

2039
01:56:28.636 --> 01:56:34.097
And anyway, we haven't had
a new God for a long time now.

2040
01:56:38.134 --> 01:56:41.626
''Hail Lord Kanji Wala.''

2041
01:56:42.233 --> 01:56:46.465
''Hail Lord Kanji Wala.''

2042
01:56:46.766 --> 01:56:51.260
''Om Lord Kanji Wala.''

2043
01:56:52.232 --> 01:56:56.760
''Sugar's high,
feeling breathless too.''

2044
01:56:57.064 --> 01:57:01.330
''Cure my swine flu.''
- Cure my swine flu.

2045
01:57:02.364 --> 01:57:05.265
l am going.
- Mahadev, wait.

2046
01:57:05.330 --> 01:57:07.127
Where are you going so hastily?

2047
01:57:07.230 --> 01:57:08.527
Forsake your anger.

2048
01:57:09.129 --> 01:57:11.654
The bed besides Kanji bhai is empty.

2049
01:57:13.096 --> 01:57:14.495
Do you want me to
reserve that for you?

2050
01:57:14.562 --> 01:57:19.727
He will forsake his
body on his birthday.

2051
01:57:21.694 --> 01:57:27.257
His shrine will be built
right where his shop was.

2052
01:57:27.326 --> 01:57:29.521
That isn't all. Now watch this.

2053
01:57:30.026 --> 01:57:32.620
All arrangements to transport
Kanji bhai's tomb has been made.

2054
01:57:32.692 --> 01:57:34.455
You snatched their business..

2055
01:57:34.526 --> 01:57:36.653
..and they made you their business.

2056
01:57:37.292 --> 01:57:38.190
Yes.

2057
01:57:38.259 --> 01:57:41.285
Kanji bhai, they've made an estimate..

2058
01:57:41.358 --> 01:57:46.022
..to earn 450 crores from your temple.

2059
01:57:46.358 --> 01:57:49.156
You're God, you
should've stopped them.

2060
01:57:49.223 --> 01:57:52.056
Friend, l would've ended the
battle of Mahabharat in a second..

2061
01:57:52.123 --> 01:57:53.351
..if l had picked up the weapon.

2062
01:57:53.422 --> 01:57:55.083
But that isn't my job.

2063
01:57:55.155 --> 01:57:58.215
My job is to show
people right and wrong.

2064
01:57:58.289 --> 01:58:00.189
This is your temple, your battle.

2065
01:58:00.256 --> 01:58:02.315
You decide what you should do.

2066
01:58:02.388 --> 01:58:06.620
Fight if you want to, or stay quiet.

2067
01:58:17.052 --> 01:58:18.451
Save him, please doctor.

2068
01:58:18.520 --> 01:58:20.317
We cannot do anything now.

2069
01:58:20.986 --> 01:58:23.454
And anyway, it's his last wish.

2070
01:58:23.519 --> 01:58:25.987
He is God.

2071
01:58:27.518 --> 01:58:28.951
Just a minute.

2072
01:58:29.018 --> 01:58:31.953
Wait here,
we'll bring the dead body out.

2073
01:58:38.016 --> 01:58:42.453
Donate as much as you wish in the donation
box kept in front of Kanji Prabhu..

2074
01:58:42.516 --> 01:58:45.110
..and have your wishes fulfilled.

2075
01:58:45.349 --> 01:58:48.546
The rate for VlP line is Rs. 101.

2076
01:58:48.615 --> 01:58:51.345
Welcome, welcome, Mahadev.

2077
01:58:52.414 --> 01:58:56.043
Swami, our very own Mahadeveshwar.

2078
01:58:56.480 --> 01:58:58.345
This is called destiny.

2079
01:58:58.413 --> 01:59:03.476
Kanji's chapter's going to
end right where it started.

2080
01:59:14.544 --> 01:59:17.035
Kanji bhai's body has gone
missing from the hospital.

2081
01:59:17.344 --> 01:59:20.472
The hospital
administration has no explanation.

2082
01:59:21.043 --> 01:59:23.944
Offerings made in
clarified butter, only Rs.25.

2083
01:59:24.042 --> 01:59:26.169
Where did Kanji disappear to?

2084
01:59:28.243 --> 01:59:30.473
Call Mr. Mishra.

2085
01:59:32.041 --> 01:59:33.065
There he is.

2086
01:59:33.141 --> 01:59:35.302
He isn't Spiderman. Find him.

2087
01:59:36.541 --> 01:59:39.271
l just found out. Don't worry.

2088
01:59:39.341 --> 01:59:41.866
l am there. l'll do something.

2089
01:59:42.207 --> 01:59:48.043
Kanji Prabhu's dead body can arrive
in the truck anytime now. - Go on.

2090
01:59:48.173 --> 01:59:53.941
Everyone please keep calm, everyone
will get a chance to behold him.

2091
01:59:54.905 --> 01:59:57.203
photographs of Sri Kanji Prabhu.

2092
01:59:57.271 --> 02:00:00.468
Kanji Prabhu's autobiography.

2093
02:00:13.336 --> 02:00:15.600
You are a fool.

2094
02:00:15.902 --> 02:00:17.335
l gave orders and you
set out to look for Kanji.

2095
02:00:17.401 --> 02:00:19.232
Who do you think he is?

2096
02:00:19.868 --> 02:00:21.392
Let's get out of here quietly,
otherwise..

2097
02:00:21.467 --> 02:00:22.900
..the people won't spare us.

2098
02:00:22.968 --> 02:00:24.629
Come on.

2099
02:00:44.798 --> 02:00:46.823
Kanji is alive.

2100
02:00:50.030 --> 02:00:51.930
Yes, l am alive.

2101
02:00:56.863 --> 02:00:58.421
What are you staring at?

2102
02:00:58.928 --> 02:01:03.160
l am the same Kanji whom
you've turned into God.

2103
02:01:03.495 --> 02:01:06.430
l don't know whether
you're great or fool.

2104
02:01:06.827 --> 02:01:10.490
l kept telling you don't
turn religion into business..

2105
02:01:10.527 --> 02:01:14.486
..you made him God and
started your business.

2106
02:01:15.960 --> 02:01:17.484
Tell me one thing.

2107
02:01:17.793 --> 02:01:21.991
The world's so beautiful,
why should God live only in temples?

2108
02:01:22.992 --> 02:01:25.222
l say, have faith in Him.

2109
02:01:25.792 --> 02:01:26.884
Believe in Him from your heart..

2110
02:01:26.958 --> 02:01:28.186
..and you will find God.

2111
02:01:28.991 --> 02:01:31.516
Try to find God in humans,
and you will find Him.

2112
02:01:31.824 --> 02:01:33.815
You will find Him in humans.

2113
02:01:33.890 --> 02:01:35.858
Not in these stones.

2114
02:01:37.023 --> 02:01:40.288
Not in these...stones.

2115
02:01:48.888 --> 02:01:51.152
They played with our emotions.

2116
02:01:51.254 --> 02:01:52.414
We won't spare them!

2117
02:01:52.454 --> 02:01:53.751
We won't spare them!

2118
02:01:53.787 --> 02:01:55.311
They spread the rumour
of your death as well.

2119
02:01:55.354 --> 02:01:57.015
They are the imposters.

2120
02:01:57.087 --> 02:01:58.748
Listen.

2121
02:01:59.186 --> 02:02:02.155
You kill two and there
are two hundred more.

2122
02:02:02.220 --> 02:02:03.915
Don't you see it on
television everyday?

2123
02:02:04.185 --> 02:02:06.881
Their real punishment is..

2124
02:02:07.018 --> 02:02:09.418
..let them leave respectfully.

2125
02:02:10.384 --> 02:02:13.376
Let them leave in
their expensive cars.

2126
02:02:13.451 --> 02:02:19.219
And no one will set foot
in their temples or hermitages.

2127
02:02:19.283 --> 02:02:20.750
Get that.

2128
02:02:20.816 --> 02:02:22.807
That will be their real punishment.

2129
02:02:23.749 --> 02:02:25.148
Please leave.

2130
02:02:52.312 --> 02:02:58.012
Faith and belief,
are very addictive, Kanji.

2131
02:02:59.277 --> 02:03:03.839
Once you're addicted to it,
you cannot let go easily.

2132
02:03:04.710 --> 02:03:06.701
All the people that you see here..

2133
02:03:07.710 --> 02:03:12.704
..they are not God-loving people,
they are God-fearing.

2134
02:03:13.242 --> 02:03:17.269
Sooner or later, you might
see them in hermitages again.

2135
02:03:21.041 --> 02:03:23.202
Be fearless!

2136
02:03:33.639 --> 02:03:37.131
So...won't you go along?

2137
02:03:38.705 --> 02:03:40.172
Come on, break the idol.

2138
02:03:41.605 --> 02:03:42.902
Papa.
- Where? Where is he?

2139
02:03:42.971 --> 02:03:48.637
l want you to promise that
no one will ever drop a penny..

2140
02:03:48.703 --> 02:03:50.671
..at any of the relegious places.

2141
02:03:55.570 --> 02:03:56.730
What are you staring at?

2142
02:03:56.802 --> 02:03:58.201
Break the statue.

2143
02:04:13.233 --> 02:04:16.669
Here, come here.
- Come, l'll introduce you to Krishna.

2144
02:04:16.732 --> 02:04:19.064
What?
- Come that way.

2145
02:04:24.165 --> 02:04:26.565
Look, Kanji bhai,
they're felling the statue.

2146
02:04:31.597 --> 02:04:33.724
lt's exactly like you wanted.

2147
02:04:34.664 --> 02:04:36.256
Look..

2148
02:04:55.561 --> 02:04:57.119
Who are you looking for, Kanji?

2149
02:05:00.027 --> 02:05:02.052
Didn't l say l am present everywhere?

2150
02:05:02.826 --> 02:05:05.090
l am pouring on fields as the rain.

2151
02:05:05.859 --> 02:05:08.191
And making nests along with the birds.

2152
02:05:08.991 --> 02:05:11.789
l am also taking lunch
with the ants down there.

2153
02:05:18.924 --> 02:05:20.721
Are you fine?
- Papa.

2154
02:05:21.123 --> 02:05:22.215
Yes, l am fine.

2155
02:05:22.523 --> 02:05:24.548
Whom did you want us to introduce to?

2156
02:05:28.022 --> 02:05:29.546
No one.

2157
02:05:29.822 --> 02:05:31.187
No one.

2158
02:05:33.588 --> 02:05:35.055
What are you doing, Kanji?

2159
02:05:35.821 --> 02:05:38.153
Don't wear this around
your neck as a talisman.

2160
02:05:39.121 --> 02:05:41.817
You finally succeeded
in explaining people..

2161
02:05:41.886 --> 02:05:43.478
..that this is wrong.

2162
02:05:43.719 --> 02:05:45.516
Throw it.

2163
02:05:45.753 --> 02:05:47.687
Throw it away.
